<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">2 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Samuel Uk Ningnaw</char> tuh <char style="bk">Samuel Uk Kheitnaw</char> te apiakuhpaw thua zah, David nynh siapharan lante ram a uknaw kong phungpaw nynh thua, masaty lan alia lang umpaw Judah ram kha uk zah (byaria 1-4), tukoute thahlang umpaw Israel ram ryte ram pynpi kha a uk (byaria 5-24). David nynh a peenaw kosah khylan te a bawitungkhung tynsah khylan ram lungkhu te ram atolang e rhaw hae kha pawtemou a dou hae cipaw a langsah. David tuh Pachia myarya a zynpaw te a doliakuhpaw nynh thua, a ccungccaw hae tuh a tungvaw kya lungzinaw a hoi hae. Tuhzemah a rynaw te a eenaw kha tungsah khylan vaekhakheit a rysawthah zah, seinaw lepaw kha a rae. Thuasalama Bawipaw profeh Nathan nynh a seinaw kha he a phy tuh, a seinaw phykuh zah Pachia detahnaw kha a teing.</para>
  <para style="ip">David a hiinnaw te a cyi khonaw tuh Israel ccungccaw hae thinlung kya ccavyng um zah, nyalang vawsawnaw a tung hae ze David kha ngae hae zah, amaw a lopaw David ciihan siapharan yn pui cih cite a ngaehoi hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">David nynh Judah ram a uknaw 1.1—4.12</para>
  <para style="io1">David nynh Israel ram pynpi a uknaw 5.1—24.25</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Atakaw lya-e kum hae 5.1—10.19</para>
  <para style="io2">b. David te Bathsheba 11.1—12.25</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Vawsawnaw te runaw hae 12.26—20.26</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Nyalang e kum hae 21.1—24.25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Saul te Jonathan elang David A Rah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul a chih koute, David nynh Amalek hae kha tae hae zah he yn ki te, David tuh Ziklag khua kya nin ning a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nin thumnaw nin khe, ccungccapaw lu kheit tuh a boeining seiikute, a lu vawlan vuiping phingkute Saul a ryahmin kyate yn thua. David kya he a thua te, laekhu kya bakhung zah sawtuanaw a pya. <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh amaw kha, “Tei langte mou nae thua?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “Israel hae ryahmin kyate nynh kae ccue,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh amaw kha, “Pawtemou athua? Yn hopya tua!” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Israel rhawkaw hae tuh rhawtuknaw kyate a ccue hae, rhawkaw patae tuh khuliakuh hae zah a chih hae; Saul te a ccapaw Jonathan mah a chih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />David nynh a hopahtupaw ccangvaepaw kyakhe, “Saul te a ccapaw Jonathan a chi hae paw tuh pawtemou na ny?” cite a khia. <verse number="6" style="v" />A hopahtupaw ccangvaepaw nynh, “Gilboa Mua vawlan ka la um lyate tungkuh zah, Saul tuh a ccoi kya a ngeiku lyakhe, marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae tuh a kalan oun naekuh vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-6">1Sa 31.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 10:1-6">1Sh 10.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul nynh a nulang he a do tuh, kae kha yn muih zah yn ko. Kae nynh, ‘E kya mang ka um, bawipaw,’ ka cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, ‘Hummou na thua?’ cite yn khia zah, kae nynh, ‘Amalek paw nynh ka thua,’ cite ka khung. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul nynh, ‘Rang, ka pe thadyn lah, yn theih; pawccecize vaemaw myarya ccih lan ka mue zah reih-i-reih-ae phang ka hiin ung,’ yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a pe ka thadyn zah ka chia, pawccecize a khuliakuh koute tuh hiin kho vae lan khyh cipaw ka ny. A lu kya umpaw bawilukhung te a kuihnyng kya umpaw khawccan kha ka lah zah, hynhlang ka bawipaw kalan kae thuakhae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh amaw boeining kha kyng zah a seiiku; a kya um hae paw balyn nynh tuhcite a cyibua hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul, a ccapaw Jonathan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rhawkaw hae te Israel hae tuh thaloi te a chi hae keiccuze minmin elang zete cia rah hae zah looh-ae a sung hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />David nynh a hopahpaw ccangvaepaw kha, “Tei langte mou nae thua?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “Kae tuh Amalek paw, ramccangpaw ccapaw nynh ka thua,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw kha chia khylan na kuih hangnua lanpaw kha na rih khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh ccangvaepaw lu kheit kha ko zah, “Hynhlang yn cceih lah, aning hynh theih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze aning nynh tuh-e paw tuh theih zah a chih. <verse number="16" style="v" />David nynh, “Na chiise tuh na lu vawlan um sah; pawccecize, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw kha ka chia vae,’ cite namaw mung ccaccei nynh ccaekia a khangku vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh Saul te a ccapaw Jonathan kha hynh-e rawnaw hlaw hynh a phua hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />(Judah hae kyakhe hynh-e hlaw hynh ccangpya athua cih, cite kaw a tho; tuh-e tuh Jashar Ccauh kya zei athua.) David nynh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:13">Jos 10.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou Israel, na phu-enaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangpaw na hmin hae</para>
  <para style="q1">vawlan khe chia athua vae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih thawsae hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe chih vae hae ccarei!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e kong tuh Gath khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ho nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ashkelon khua laanpi hae kya mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ho nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhkhyhze tuh Filistin ccanung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungpawsei cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">vingdungawkuh lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccanung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungtuasei cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pou Gilboa mua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae vawlan kya dangtui</para>
  <para style="q1">ccah nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaa mah rah nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">looh patae voipaw loo mah</para>
  <para style="q2">um nan sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize tuin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawsae hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">khawriaphua tuh a nungsikuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Saul a khawriaphua tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">chitui thuh thua vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chia athuapaw ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">chiise kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thawsae hae paw tho</para>
  <para style="q2">kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jonathan li tuh nulang</para>
  <para style="q2">ki hang khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Saul thaloi tuh a ccakaete</para>
  <para style="q2">ki hang khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul te Jonathan,</para>
  <para style="q2">sungsakuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">sungsah lan a um hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Hiinnaw kya thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw kya thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">phiakuh khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh mosipi laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ranghua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih laeze mih thawsaehua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pou Israel ccanung hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Saul hanlan rawtua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh apuithyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">boei sepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae zingsah oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae boeining kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaannawpaw sui te</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ccaanpya oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mih rawthungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtukku cciamang lya</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh vae hae!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Jonathan tuh ahangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na hmin hae kya a chia vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka neitaw Jonathan,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang na hanlan ka ngaethah;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh myarya kae sungsahpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae sungsahnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangthua lan um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nopi hae sungsahnaw po alawe.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mih rawthung hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a chih vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknawpaw zunghe hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aroh vae hae! a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Siapharan lang David A Tang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Judah ram e khua khuakhakheit kalan ka cceihthung cih tou?” cite a khia. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha, “Cceihthung” a cipya. David nynh, “Tei khua lang mou ka cceihthung cih?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Hebron khua lang,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David tuh tuin khua langkhe a zu hae lu ning, Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam te Nabal nynh a chitawpaw nomaenung, Karmel khuanung Abigail ryte a cceihthung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1Sa 25.42-43</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh a kya um hae paw kha mih innbyn raveih ryte cciakhae thung hae zah, Hebron khua pe umpaw khua hae kyakhe a um hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Judah ccungccaw hae tuh oun thua hae zah, tuin kyakhe David kha Judah siapharan lang chitui a thuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">“Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae nynh Saul rhua kha a uu hae,” cite David kha he a hopah hae te,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:11-13">1Sa 31.11-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />David nynh Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae kalan khe locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Nanning nynh nae bawipaw Saul tungvaw kya lungzinaw na langsakuh oh zah a rhua kha na uu oh keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua ae pya vae oh sah! <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae tungvaw kya atynpaw sungsahnaw te lungzinaw kha langsakuh vae sah! E rya hynh na law oh keiccuze kae nynh mah nae tungvaw hoynaw ka rae cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae thawsae sah lah, nae rawthung sah; pawccecize nae bawipaw Saul tuh chih vae zah Judah hae nynh kae hynh siapharan lang chitui yn thuh vae hae,” cite bya a taw hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ishbaal Israel Siapharan lang Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Ner ccapaw Abner, Saul a rhawbawipaw nynh Saul ccapaw Ishbaal kha ko zah Mahanaim khua lang a cciakhae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Abner nynh Ishbaal kha Gilead, Ashur, Jezreel, Efraim, Benjamin te Israel ram balyn kha a uktupaw siapharan lang a khang. <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul ccapaw Ishbaal nynh Israel ram a uk takaw lya tuh kum sung pali acih vae, aning nynh kum ning a uk. Thuasalama Judah hae nynh tuh David kha a zui hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />David tuh Hebron khua kya siapharan lang um zah Judah hae a uk ccyh tuh kum sari te sah taruh acih vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gibeon Rhawtuknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ner ccapaw Abner te Saul ccapaw Ishbaal a ryalahtu hae tuh Mahanaim khua kyate Gibeon khua lang a cceih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Joab te David a ryalahtu hae tuh cceih hae zah minmin ryte Gibeon tuili pe khe a tungkuh hae. Phu kheit tuh tuili voikheit lang raw kya haung hae zah ccangpaw phu kheit tuh tuili voikheih lang raw kya a haung hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Abner nynh Joab kha, “Ccangvae hae tuh malang pou hae sah lah, aening malang hin zuepaw taekuh hae sah,” a cipya. Joab nynh, “Ou, malang pou hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze malang pou hae zah a ccia lya hae khe a ria hae, Benjamin phin te Saul ccapaw Ishbaal hanlan lu haw lae ning pou hae zah, David a ryalahtu hae mah lu haw lae ning a pou hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Lu kheit cci nynh amaw a rhawpaw kha a lu te kyng zah a naw kha thaloi te a thuing; tukeiccuze pynkheihlan a khuliakuh hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Helkath-hazzumrim cite ko hae zah Gibeon kya a um. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuin nin kya thawte rhaw a tukkuh hae; David a ryalahtu hae nynh Abner te Israel hae kha a tae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw hae lu thum, Joab, Abishai te Asahel tuh tuin kya a umbua hae. Asahel tuh ramkaw e sazuh hawte a liazaw. <verse number="19" style="v" />Asahel nynh Abner kha voilang ranglang maeku leite a dee. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh Abner nynh nulang do zah, “Asahel tou na thua?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “Ou, ka thua,” cite a khung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner nynh amaw kha, “Na voilang khyhze na ranglang maekuh lah, ccangvae lukhakheit kha kyngte a uccaw kha luade tua,” a cipya. Thuasalama Asahel nynh ccanglang maeku leite amaw kha a deehui. <verse number="22" style="v" />Abner nynh Asahel kha, “Nae deehuinaw kyate ccanglang maekuh; pawccemou nang kha laekhu kya kae khulia cih? Na upaw Joab malang khe pawtemou ka mae ka langsakuh ngan cih?” cite bua a hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama Asahel nynh ccanglang maekuh ry khyh. Tukeiccuze Abner nynh aning kha a ccoi dung te a vue kya thuing zah a ke lang po zua; tuin kya khuliakuh zah a chih. Asahel nynh khuliakuh zah a chinaw hmin kya a thuapaw balyn tuh a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama Joab te Abishai nynh Abner kha a deehui hae. Khuanin he a ccaw lyakhe Gibeon ramkaw lang ccianaw laanpi kya umpaw Giah khua a malang e Ammah mua kya a thua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae tuh Abner kalan khe sueluakuh hae zah phu kheit lang umte mua dung khe thadynnaw hmin a tahkuh hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh Abner nynh Joab kha ko zah, “Aening hynh zungzae po douku lan tou? Athangnaw tuh myarya yn ccih cih cipaw na nyh khyh tou? Na ccungccaw hae tuh mih puizia hae deehuinaw kyate nulang a ki nawlan hae, hohseciamou kawpya lei hae te na um ung cih?” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab nynh, “Pachia tuh a hiin thyhte, nang nynh tuhcite na ho khyh lanze, ka ccungccaw hae nynh mih puizia hae kha umtaw leite awkhualan awkhua cia po a deehui cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab nynh mungkae tu zah ccungccaw balyn nynh Israel hae deehuinaw kha umtaw hae zah rhaw mah tuk vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abner te a ccungccaw hae nynh azi zidae Arabah accya kha po zuate a cceih hae; Jordan vaw kha zuate awkhualan awkhua balyn tuh po cceih hae zah Mahanaim khua kya a thua hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Joab tuh Abner deehuinaw kyate a ki; te ccungccaw balyn kha he a pum hae tuh, David a ryalahtu hae kya-e Asahel holeite lu haw lae takua azo hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />David a ryalahtu hae nynh Benjamin phin hae, Abner a ccungccaw hae za thum sung taruh kha a chia hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Asahel rhua kha lah hae zah Bethlehem khua umpaw a paaw shawku kya a uu hae. Joab te a ccungccaw hae tuh azi zidae cceih hae zah Hebron khua khe khua nynh a dae phaw hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Abner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul innbyn te David innbyn hae tuh khaw cia rhaw a tukkuh vae hae; David tuh houhouh a thawsae thung zah, Saul innbyn tuh a thaw houhouh zyabung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh Hebron khua kya a saah hae paw ccapaw hae tuh: a ccatawccaw tuh Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam kya a saahpaw Amnon nynh thua, <verse number="3" style="v" />lu ningnaw tuh Karmel khuapaw Nabal nynh a chitawpaw nomaenung Abigail kya a saahpaw Khileab nynh thua; lu thumnaw tuh Geshur siapharan Talmai ccanung Maakah a ccapaw Absalom nynh thua; <verse number="4" style="v" />lu palinaw tuh Haggith ccapaw Adonijah nynh thua; lu pangawnaw tuh Abital ccapaw Shefatiah nynh thua; <verse number="5" style="v" />lu taruhnaw tuh David zu Eglah kya a saahpaw Ithream nynh thua. E hae hynh David nynh Hebron khua kya a saah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul innbyn te David innbyn hae rhaw a tukku lya hae khe, Abner nynh amaw te amaw kha Saul innbyn kalan te a thaw a saesaku. <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul nynh Aiah ccanung Rizpah kha a lovae lang a hoiku. Ishbaal nynh Abner kha, “Pawccemou ka paaw lovaenung kha na ikhae?” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ishbaal bya keiccuze Abner tuh myarya a thinria zah, “Kae tuh Judah hae ui lu tou ka thua? Atunin cia na paaw Saul innbyn te a uno hae te a ruiban hae tungvaw kya lungzinaw ka hoi zah, nang kha David kuih kalan kae pya khyh; tuhzemah atu vae tuh nang nynh hynh-e nopinung te nae ruphuh. <verse number="9-10" style="v" />Peenaw kha Saul ciihan kyate ccaring lawte David a bawitungkhung tuh Israel ram te Judah ram kya, Dan khua kyate Beersheba khua kyacia tynsah khylan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kya bya a kinpyakupaw kha ka ccingsahpah cih, Pachia nynh Abner tungvaw kya tuhcite cyih sah lah, tuhlaeze mah cyichih vae sah,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1Sa 15.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Ishbaal nynh Abner kha a ri keiccuze ccangpaw bya kaw kheit sanmah khung kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abner nynh David kalan Hebron khua langkhe locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Ram hynh hum kya-e mou athua? Kae te byakinnaw rae lah, Israel hae balyn hynh na kalan pybia lan kae bawm cih,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="13" style="v" />David nynh, “Ahoy, nang te byakinnaw ka rae cih. Thuasalama kae ngia rypaw ccangkheit a um: kae kha muih khylan he nae cceih te, Saul ccanung Mikhal kha nae thuakhae khyh zetuh, ka malang nae langkuh lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh Saul ccapaw Ishbaal kalan locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Filistin hae vingdung za kheit kha mee lang ka syanuathepaw ka zu Mikhal kha yn pya,” cite bya a taw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:27">1Sa 18.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Ishbaal nynh ccungccaw sawte tuh-e nopinung tuh Laish ccapaw a vawpaw Paltiel kyate a kosah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />A vawpaw tuh a nulang te Bahurim khua kyacia rawkhuite a zuikuh. Abner nynh Patiel kha, “Inn lang la ki ccavae!” cipah zah a ki vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abner nynh Israel piccan hae kalan khe, “Anuhlang lya mawte David kha nae siapharan lang na ry vae oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Atu tuh ccingsah ccavae oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha byakinpakuh zah: Ka ryalahtu David kha mangte ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha Filistin hae kuih kyate thuasah, mih rhaw hae balyn kyate thuasah ka khum cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Abner nynh Benjamin phin hae kha mah a hopya hae; te Israel hae te Benjamin ciihan hae balyn nynh cyi lan a ry hae paw balyn kha Hebron khua kya David kha hopya khylan Abner tuh a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abner nynh ccungccaw hae lu kuin ryte Hebron khua, David kya he a thua hae tuh, David nynh Abner te a kya um hae paw elang looh-aenaw poi a tuapya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner nynh David kha, “Israel hae balyn nynh nang te byakinnaw a rae nawlan hae thuasah, na lung nynh a ry hawte na uk nawlan hae thuasah ka la cceih sah lah, mih balynte siapharan ka bawipaw kalan kae suelua cih hae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze David nynh Abner kha cciasah zah lungdaete a cceih vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joab nynh Abner A Chia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sosoh koute Joab te David a ryalahtu hae tuh rhaw a thiingnaw hae kyate oun thua hae zah luadepaw uccaw patae kha oun phubia hae. Thuasalama Abner tuh Hebron khua kya David ryte umkheih khyh hae, pawccecize David nynh cciasah zah aning tuh lungdaete phe a cceih vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab te a kya umpaw rhawkaw hae balyn he oun thua hae te, Joab kyakhe, “Ner ccapaw Abner tuh siapharan kalan yn thua zah, aning nynh cciasah zah lungdaete phe cceih vae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh Joab nynh siapharan kalan cceih zah, “Pawmou phe na la cyi vae? Abner tuh na kalan yn thua zah a lue ccaw cite pawccemou na cciasah? <verse number="25" style="v" />Ner ccapaw Abner tuh nang kha ling khylan te na tee na pounaw te na cyipaw balyn kha ny khylan nynh yn thua cipaw phe na ny,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David kyate a pou koute, Joab nynh Abner nulang te locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, Sirah tuisung kyate phe a kikhae hae; tuh-e konglang tuh David nynh nyh khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Abner tuh Hebron lang he a ki te, Joab nynh byarupaw hoku khylan koikua pe lang cciakhae zah, tuin kyakhe a vue kha a thuing. Tuhcite Joab a neitaw Asahel chiise a luapaw hanlan Abner tuh a chih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nyalangte, David nynh tuh-e tuh he a thae te, “Ner ccapaw Abner chiise hanlan kae te ka peenaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang kae cyiseinaw papin um khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuh-e cyiseinaw tuh Joab lu vawlan te a puizia hae balyn lu vawlan khe ccah vae sah; te Joab a puizia hae kya anae poupaw, vaethyakaepaw, a kekypaw, thaloi te chihpaw, a kanmawpaw thouh boi nan sah!” a ci. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhcite Joab te a neitaw Abishai nynh Abner kha a chia hae, pawccecize Gibeon khua rhawtuknaw kyakhe Abner nynh mih neitaw Asahel kha a la chia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David nynh Joab te a kya um hae paw balyn kha, “Nae boeining kha seii oh lah, buriboei kha zingkuh oh, te Abner hanlan rah oh,” a cipya hae. David siapharan nynh michi rhua-thingkua kha a zui. <verse number="32" style="v" />Abner kha Hebron kya a uu hae. Siapharan nynh Abner shawku kya thawte a roisaw zah a rah, ccungccaw balyn mah a rah hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Abner hanlan rawnaw hlawsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Abner tuh mingaee</para>
  <para style="q2">a chi hawte tou a chih cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na kuih kha khi thua khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccu kha khinawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">arui te khii thua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hoyleipaw malang</para>
  <para style="q1">a khuliakuhpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na khuliakuh vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">a ci. Te ccungccaw balyn tuh aning elang bua a rah hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Khua azi mawkhe David nynh looh a ae nawlan ccungccaw balyn nynh a soihbia hae; thuasalama David nynh byakinkuh zah, “Khuanin accaw maw kya sanlou thuasah, ccangpaw hankhakheit thuasah ka taangtua lanze, Pachia nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e ciate thuasah, tuhlaeze alung lante mah thuasah cyih vae sah!” a ci. <verse number="36" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn nynh tuh-e tuh muih hae zah mih lungtua; siapharan nynh a cyipaw miakaw kha ccungccaw balyn nynh mih lungrythua. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ner ccapaw Abner chianaw kya siapharan panbua khyh cipaw kha tuin nin khe ccungccaw balyn te Israel hae balyn nynh a thaethya hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh a ryalahtu hae kyakhe, “Israel hae kyaze bawi lu kheit athuapaw alesaepaw ccungccaw lu kheit tuh atunin a chih vae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="39" style="v" />Siapharan lang chitui thuh ka thua zemah atunin kya ka thawzya. E Zeruiah ccapaw hae hynh ka hanlan myaryamaw a puatho hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hoyleinaw a raetupaw kha a hoyleinaw thyhte a liaru!” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ishbaal Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abner tuh Hebron khua kya a chih vae cipaw kha Saul ccapaw Ishbaal nynh he a thae tuh, a thawthah zah, Israel hae balyn tuh mih bungzou. <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul ccapaw nynh rhaw a thiingpaw aphu hae rhawbawi lu ning a hoi; lu kheit min tuh Baanah cikuh zah ccangpaw lu kheit min tuh Rekhab acikuh. Minmin tuh Beeroth khua kya-e Benjamin phinpaw Rimmon ccapaw hae nynh athua hae—pawccecize Beeroth khua tuh Benjamin ram kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />(Beeroth ccungccaw hae tuh Gittaim lang ccue hae zah, tuin kyakhe atunin cia ramccang ccungccaw lante a um hae).</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul ccapaw Jonathan nynh a ccukhoupaw ccapaw lu kheit a hoi. Saul te Jonathan konglang Jezreel khua kyate thongpang yn than lyaze aning tuh kum pangaw acih vae. Aning a do-oihtunung nynh lah zah a ccuekhae; arangte a ccuekhae lyakhe phe ccahsei zah a ccu akhou. A min tuh Mefibosheth acikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:3">2Sa 9.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beeroth khuapaw Rimmon ccapaw hae Rekhab te Baanah tuh thokuh hae zah ninthu khuaninso lya loukaw khe Ishbaal inn kya a thua hae, Ishbaal tuh ninthu a haeung ccyh lya nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh chanvuih law lan a tee hae paw hawte inn lungkhu lang tee hae zah Ishbaal vue kha a thuing hae; tukoute Rekhab te a uno Baanah tuh a ccue hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />A inaw khaan kya ikhung vawlan a i lyakhe inn lungkhu lang teenua hae zah, Ishbaal kha theih hae zah a lu a pae hae. A lu kha lah hae zah Arabah laanpi te azi zidae a cceih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ishbaal lu kha Hebron khua e David kalan a thuakhae hae, te siapharan kyakhe, “E hynh na hiinnaw ae ccungpaw na rhawpaw, Saul ccapaw Ishbaal lu nynh thua; atunin kya siapharan ka bawipaw hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Saul te a ciihan tungvaw kya phu ae lawpya vae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David nynh Beeroth khuapaw Rimmon ccapaw hae Rakhad te a unopaw Baanah kyakhe, “Rhaw hae balyn kyate ka hiinnaw yn shawkhawpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, <verse number="10" style="v" />ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh thongpang hoypaw ka phupya cite tua zah, ‘Dotua, Saul tuh a chih vae,’ cite he yn hopah te, aning kha ka kyng zah Ziklag kya ka chia; tuh-e tuh thongpang yn phutupaw elang ka pyapaw lasung nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:1-16">2Sa 1.1-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh midingpaw kha amaw inn kya a ikhung vawlan khe a chia hae ze, tuhlaeze houh cyi lan accan khaw! Atu aning chiise mee kha nanning kya ngiate, nanning kha laephi vawlan te kae roh lan khyh oh tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te David nynh ccangvae hae kha kawpya hae zah minmin kha a chia hae; mih kuih mih ccu kha pae hae zah, mih pyn kha Hebron khua e tuili pe khe a sae hae. Ishbaal lu kha tuh lah hae zah Hebron khua e Abner shawku kya a uu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel te Judah Siapharan lang David Chitui Thuhnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1Sh 11.1-9</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel phin hae balyn nynh Hebron khua umpaw David kalan oun thua hae zah, “Dotua, kaening tuh na ru te na saw nynh kae thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Anuhlang lya, Saul nynh siapharan lang oun tangpya lyaze, Israel hae oun poukhaetu te oun teekhaetu tuh namaw nynh na thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae hopah zah: ‘Nang tuh ka ccungccaw Israel hae tuurin na thua cih zah, Israel hae uktu na thua cih,’ ae cipya,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel piccan hae balyn tuh Hebron khua umpaw David kalan a thua hae; David siapharan tuh Hebron khua <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe minmin ryte byakinnaw rae zah, David kha Israel siapharan lang chitui a thuh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh siapharan lang a tang takaw lya tuh kum sung thum acih vae, kum sung pali lungkhu siapharan lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:11">1Si 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1Sh 3.4</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 29:27">29.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Hebron khua kya Judah ram kha kum sari sah taruh a uk; Jerusalem khua kya Israel ram balyn te Judah ram kha sung thum kum thum a uk.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem kha Khuapi lang Raenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siapharan te a ccungccaw hae tuh Jebus hae kha dou khylan Jerusalem lang a cceih hae, ram lungkhu um hae paw nynh David kha, “Hynhlang nae tee lan khyh, mitzu hae te ccukhou hae nynh heize nang kha ae khee kho cih hae,” a cipya hae—minmin nynh, “David nynh hynhlang tee kho lan khyh,” cite a tua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Jos 15.63</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Bpt 1.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama atu David khua a ci hae paw Zion rhawlungrua kha David nynh a law. <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh tuin nin khe, “Jebus hae kha chia a rypaw miakaw nynh, David nynh a hua hae paw mitzu hae te ccukhou hae kha tuk khylan, tuizypi kha po kae hae sah,” a ci. Tukeiccu nynh tuh-e tuh, “Mitzu hae te ccukhou hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang tee lan khyh hae,” cite a honaw hae paw athua. <verse number="9" style="v" />David tuh rhawlungrua lungkhu khe um zah, tuh-e tuh David khua cite min a phu. David nynh khua kha Millo kyate alungkhu lang cia po voilu lan a koih. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaaw Pachia tuh David kya a um keiccuze aning tuh houhouh a lesae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tair siapharan Hiram nynh locceihtu hae kha sidar thing hae, lehccama hae te pazan thya hae paw ryte David kalan saw hae zah, minmin nynh David kha inn a sakpya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha Israel siapharan lang a khangpaw te a ccungccaw Israel hae hanlan a peenaw a hangthungpaw kha David nynh a ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David tuh Hebron khua te a nuekuh koute, Jerusalem khua khe zupi hae te lovae hae kha hoikuh chih zah, David nynh ccanung ccapaw hae kha a saahku hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem kya a saah hae paw a ccapaw hae min tuh: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon, <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nefeg, Jafia, <verse number="16" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada te Elifelet nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Filistin hae kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1Sh 14.8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David tuh Israel siapharan lang chitui a thuh vae hae cipaw kha Filistin hae nynh he a thae hae te, Filistin hae balyn nynh David kha ccung khylan a cceih hae; tuh-e konglang tuh David nynh thae zah rhawlungrua kalan a cceih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh oun cceih hae zah Refaim accya khe pong pazaekuh lante a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha khia zah, “Filistin hae kha tuk lan ka ccianua thung cih hae tou? Minmin kha ka kuih kalan nae pya cih hae tou?” a cipya. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha, “Ccianua thung hae; pawccecize Filistin hae kha na kuih kalan kae pya ccaccing cih,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David tuh Baal-perazim lang cceih zah, tuin kyakhe minmin kha a tae hae. David nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka rhaw hae kha avuakuhpaw tuileih hawte ka malang khe a vuasaku vae hae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Baal-perazim cite a ko hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh mih zohtuh hae kha tuin kya vuasya hae zah, David te a ccungccaw hae nynh a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh bua oun cceih hae zah, Refaim accya khe pong pazaekuh lante a um hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha he a khia tuh, “Na cceihthung lan khyh; mih nulang te koihlu hae lah, balsam thing hae te arawsekunaw kyakhate na naangbia cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Balsam thing dung hae kyakhe ccu cciapaw siho kha he na thae te, na naangbia vae cih hae; pawccecize Filistin rhawkaw hae kha chia khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na malang a cceih lalo vae,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya thyhte David nynh cyih zah, Filistin hae kha Geba kyate Gezer kyacia po a chia hae.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem lang Thingkua Nuenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1Sh 13.1-14</ref>, 15.25—16.6, 43)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh Israel hae kya-e popaw ccungccaw hae thong sung thum kha bua a pum hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Cherubim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cherubim: </char><char style="ft">cipaw tuh a sake saepaw sarangpaw phuin kheit, vaawccungccaw alopaw nynh thua.</char></note> vawlan a umpaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te ko athuapaw Pachia thingkua kha Judah ram Baalah khua kyate cciakhae khylan David te a kya um hae paw balyn tuh thokuh hae zah a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Exo 25.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia thingkua kha vaetuale thawpaw kya khang hae zah mua vawlan umpaw Abinadab inn kyate a poukhae hae. Abinadab ccapaw hae Uzzah te Ahio nynh<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1Sa 7.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia thingkua a umpaw vaetuale thawpaw kha a mawng hae; Ahio tuh thingkua malang khe a cceih. <verse number="5" style="v" />David te Israel hae balyn tuh hlaw, tintang, tyng, daw te lanchi hae khate mih thawzung balynte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nakon huimin kya he a thua hae te, tangnuapaw hae nynh Pachia thingkua kha a thyngbia hae keiccuze Uzzah nynh a kuih dyng zah thingkua kha a kyng. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Uzzah tungvaw myarya a thinria; thingkua kalan a kuih a dyng keiccuze Pachia nynh detah zah, Pachia thingkua pe khe a chih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pachia nynh Uzzah tungvaw a thinria zah de a tah keiccuze David tuh a thinria; tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh atunin cia Perez-uzzah cite a ko hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin khe David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua hynh pawtemou ka kalan a thua kho cih?” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha David khua lungkhu lang teekhae ry khyh; David nynh Git khuapaw Obed-edom inn langkhe a cciakhae. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua tuh Git khuapaw Obed-edom inn kya sawpaw sah thum a um; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Obed-edom te a innbyn hae balyn kha hythua a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">1Sh 26.4-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pachia thingkua liate Obed-edom a innbyn hae te a inn um hae paw balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua a pya hae,” cite David Siapharan kha a hopya hae. Tukeiccuze David nynh cceih zah Pachia thingkua kha Obed-edom inn kyate David khua lang lungpawte a cciakhae; <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua a puihtu hae nynh kaw taruh he a kaw hae te, tangnuapaw sa kheit te sahiin athopaw sa kheit khate si a law. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a thawzung balynte a law; David tuh laaw te kuakuhpaw ranpibawi angki a kikuh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhcite David te Israel hae balyn nynh sia biate, mungkae tu biate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua tuh David khua lungkhu he a thua lyakhe, Saul ccanung Mikhal nynh thanlan-aw kyate do zah, David Siapharan tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe thohkute a lawpaw kha muih zah a thinlung kyate a theihrya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha teekhae hae zah, David nynh a sakpyapaw bu lungkhu, amaw hmin kyakhe a nung hae; te David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae. <verse number="18" style="v" />David nynh maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae koute, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te ccungccaw hae kha hythua a pya hae, <verse number="19" style="v" />te ccungccaw balyn kha looh a nee hae, Israel zapi hae, nopi pise hae balyn kha sanlou phe kheit, saw nge kheit te misu thae aroupaw phe kheit cci kha ccarou a nee hae. Tukoute ccungccaw hae balyn tuh mih inn lang a ki hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:43">1Sh 16.43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David tuh a innbyn hae kha hythuapya khylan a ki. Saul ccanung Mikhal tuh David te tungku khylan yn pou zah, “A thualahpaw ccungccaw nynh maethya ny leite a boeining a kalyngku hawte, atunin a ryalahtu hae kya-e ryalahtunung hae malang khe a boeining kalyngkute Israel siapharan tuh atunin kya hohcih baban mou sawtuanaw a raeku!” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />David nynh Mikhal kha, “Na paaw te a innbyn hae balyn hanpaw kae kha yn po zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae, Israel hae a uktu bawi lang yn nungpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khaw ka langku, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang ka law cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />E laeze theihrya lan umpaw kha ka cyih ung cih, kamaw mit kya heize ka thethah cih; thuasalama na ho hae paw ryalahtunung hae liate sawtuanaw ka ccou cih,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Saul ccanung Mikhal tuh a chi nin cia ccaawsaah khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David tungvaw Pachia Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1Sh 17.1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a pepan e a rhaw hae balyn kyate haeungnaw pya zah, a inn kya a um lyakhe, <verse number="2" style="v" />siapharan nynh profeh Nathan kha, “Dotua, kae tuh sidar thing inn kya ka um, thuasalama Pachia thingkua tuh bu kya nynh a um,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nathan nynh siapharan kha, “La cceih lah, na thinlung kya a umpaw balyn kha la cyih, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na kya a um,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama tuin khuazi khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Nathan kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="5" style="v" />La cceih lah, ka ryalahtu David kha la hopah: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka um nawlan inn nae sakpah cih tou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae kha Izip ram kyate ka cciakhae nin hae kyate atunin cia inn lungkhu kya ka um boi khyh, bu te beikbu lungkhu umte ka nuekuh bungthung. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel hae balyn ryte kae ccia bungthungnaw takyh kya ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha do-oih khylan kaw ka pyapaw Israel phin cciakhaetu lukhakheit kha, “Pawccemou sidar thing inn nae sakpya khyh?” cite ka hopah boi tou? <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ryalahtu David kha hynhte na hopah cih: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang tuh ka ccungccaw Israel hae kya bawi lang tang khylan tuu rampaeekunaw hmin kyate, tuu hae na zuinaw kyakhate kae ko; <verse number="9" style="v" />na ccianaw takyh kya na kya ka um zah, na rhaw hae balyn kha na malang te ka vua hae; laephi vawlan e alesae hae paw min hawte alesaepaw min kha kae raepah cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw Israel hae elang hmin ccangkheit ka raepah cih hae zah, mimaw hmin kya a um nawlan hae te kaccohkale nung athua khyh nawlan hae, ka tynsah cih hae; <verse number="11" style="v" />langmawlya ka ccungccaw Israel hae kya byapiatu hae ka nungpya lya hae hawte ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh vawsawnaw pya vae lan khyh hae; na rhaw hae balyn kyate nang kha haeungnaw kae pya cih. Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha inn innkheit ae raepah cih cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae thaesah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ccyh zaw vae zah na minpaaw hae ryte he na ihkheih oh te, na pyn kyate a pou cih paw na ciihan tuh namaw koute ka hangthung cih zah a peenaw kha ka tynsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">Sam 89.3-4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:11">132.11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">Joh 7.42</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:30">Loc 2.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh ka min hanlan inn a sak cih zah a peenaw kha ka tynsah cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Kae tuh a paaw ka thua cih zah aning tuh ka ccapaw athua cih, hoyleinaw a rae ze, ccungccaw nynh a mangthyapaw ccungngue khate thuasah, ccungccaw nynh a buanaw thyapaw ruising khate thuasah de ka tah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:26-27">Sam 89.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:18">2Ko 6.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb 1.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama na malang te ka vua vae paw Saul kyate atynpaw ka sungsahnaw kha ka law hawte aning kyate ka lah lan khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na inn te na peenaw tuh ka malang khe zungzae atyn lante rae athua cih; na bawitungkhung tuh zungzae atyn cih, a ci cite David kha la hopah, a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:36-37">Sam 89.36-37</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />E bya hae balyn thyhte, e vizin hae balyn thyhte Nathan nynh David kha a hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1Sh 17.16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh David siapharan nynh alungkhu lang tee zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang haung zah, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kae tuh ahum ka thua zah, ka innbyn tuh pawcihawpaw innbyn athua keiccu mou hynhcih ciate nae hangthung? <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama pou Bawipaw PACHIA, e hynh tuh nang na muihnaw kya uccaw dihpaw nynh thua; na ryalahtu innbyn kong hynh mah malang ccyh hynhsepi hanlan cia na hoty vae. Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, e hynh ccungccaw hae elang thuiheinaw thua vae sah! <verse number="20" style="v" />David nynh na kalan pawmou a ho kholae ung cih? Pawccecize pou Bawipaw PACHIA, na ryalahtupaw kha phe na ny! <verse number="21" style="v" />Na byakinnaw keiccu thuasah, na thinlung thyhte thuasah na ryalahtupaw nynh a ny nawlan, e lesaenaw balyn hynh na rae vae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, nang tuh na lesae; pawccecize kae nakaring te kae thaepaw balyn thyhte nang ae lopaw lu kheit san um khyh zah namaw laelan ccangpaw Pachia um khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae alopaw, Israel hae alopaw hummou a um? Minphuin hae te mih pachia hae kha a ccungccaw hae malang te ccaring deete, minmin elang alesaepaw te ngaeang lan umpaw uccaw hae kha raete a ccungccaw hae lang tang lan shawkhaw khylan te amaw hanlan min ccangkheit raeku khylan Pachia nynh a ccianua hae paw laephi vawlan ccangpaw minphuin a um tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:34">Deu 4.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ccungccaw Israel hae kha na ccungccaw lang zungzae tang khylan namaw hanlan na tynsah hae; pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh mih Pachia lang na tang. <verse number="25" style="v" />Atu pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, na ryalahtupaw konglang te a innbyn konglang na ho vae paw bya kha zungzae tynsah tua; bya na kinku hawte beih cyitua. <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Israel a uktu Pachia nynh thua,’ cite na min tuh zungzae hangthung thua sah; na ryalahtu David innbyn tuh namaw malang tyn vae sah. <verse number="27" style="v" />Pawccecize pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, nang nynh e byaphy hynh na ryalahtu hanlan na rae zah, ‘Nang kha inn innkheit kae raepah cih,’ na ci; tukeiccuze na ryalahtu nynh namaw kalan hynh-e sawsangnaw hynh ka sang ngan. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, nang tuh Pachia nynh na thua, na bya tuh kyh zah, e uccaw hoypaw hynh na ryalahtu kya bya na kinpyaku vae; <verse number="29" style="v" />tukeiccuze atu tuh na ryalahtu innbyn hynh namaw malang zungzae tyn sah cite hythuapya khylan na lungrythua sah; pawccecize pou Bawipaw PACHIA, na ho vae hawte na ryalahtu inn tuh na hythuanaw khate zungzae hythuaccou vae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh A Taepaw Rhawtuknaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1Sh 18.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute David nynh Filistin hae kha tuk hae zah a tae hae; David nynh Filistin hae kuih kya umpaw Metheg-ammah khua kha a law.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab hae kha tae hae zah, laekhu kya luesahte arui te a tou hae, arui ruining kha chia lan tou hae zah ruikheit kha haang lan a tou hae. Te Moab hae tuh David rya a lahtu lang tang hae zah ngunto a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zobah siapharan, Rehob ccapaw Hadadezer nynh Zufrates vaw pepan e ram hae kha lawthui khylan a ccia lyakhe David nynh amaw kha a chia. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh aning kyate marang rhawkaw thong kheit za sari te ccu rhawkaw thong kuin kha a kyng hae. David nynh marangle a suepaw marang hae balyn kha a chia hae, thuasalama marangle za kheit hanlan phe azaw lante a haang bang hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaskas khua e Siria hae nynh Zobah siapharan Hadadezer kha bawm khylan he oun cceih hae tuh, David nynh Siria hae kha thong kuin lae ning a chia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh Damaskas khua e Siria hae kyakhe rhawviatu hae kha a nung hae; Siria hae tuh David rya a lahtu lang tang hae zah ngunto a pya hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a ccianaw takyh kya taenaw a pya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Hadadezer a ryalahtu hae nynh a ccyng hae paw sui khawriaphua hae kha David nynh lah zah Jerusalem lang a phu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezer kya-e khua hae Betah te Berothai kyate sohin patae kha David nynh a law.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hadadezer a rhawkaw hae balyn kha David nynh a tae vae cipaw Hamath siapharan Toi nynh he a thae te, <verse number="10" style="v" />David nynh Hadadezer kha tuk zah a tae keiccuze byabeih khylan te lungtuakhae khylan David Siapharan kalan khe a ccapaw Joram kha a saw; Hadadezer nynh Toi kha atu te atu rhaw a tuk. Joram nynh ngun, sui, sohin te raekuhpaw uccaw hae kha a ccyngpya; <verse number="11" style="v" />tuh-e uccaw hae kha mah David Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pya; aning nynh a taepaw minphuin hae balyn kyate a lawpaw ngun te sui ryte pynkheihlan a pya; <verse number="12" style="v" />tuh-e sui te ngun hae tuh Edom ram, Moab ram, Ammon ram, Ammon hae, Filistin hae, Amalek ram kyate a lawpaw te Zobah siapharan Rehob ccapaw Hadadezer kyate a luadepaw nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David tuh a min myarya thaan. He yn ki te, Edom hae thong haw lae tarya kha Loi Accya kya a chia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60">Sam 60</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Edom ram kya rhawviatu hae kha a nung hae; Edom ram balyn phe lekuh lan rhawviatu hae kha nung hae zah Edom hae balyn tuh David ryalahtu lang a tang hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a ccianaw takyh kya taenaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Kuihkaw e Bawi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhcite David nynh Israel ram pynpi kha a uk; David nynh a ccungccaw hae balyn kha byading te ngingnaw te a uk hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Joab tuh rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi thua zah Ahilud ccapaw Jehoshafat tuh ccazing kyngtu nynh thua; <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahitub ccapaw Zadok te Abiathar ccapaw Ahimelek tuh ranpibawi hae thua hae zah, Seraiah tuh ryaccinkhan nynh thua; <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh Khereth hae te Peleth hae kha a uk hae; David ccapaw hae tuh ranpibawi hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Mefibosheth Thaw A Cci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh, “Jonathan keiccuze a tungvaw kya thawccinaw ka langsaku nawlan, Saul innbyn kya a hiinhypaw lu kheit san a um ung tou?” cite a khia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:15-17">1Sa 20.15-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul innbyn kya-e ryalahtu lu kheit, a min Ziba cikuhpaw um zah David kalan a ko hae. Siapharan nynh, “Nang hynh Ziba na thua tou?” cite a khia. Ziba nynh, “Na ryalahtu kae tuh Ziba nynh ka thua!” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Pachia thawccinaw tuh a tungvaw kya ka langsaku nawlan, Saul innbyn kya a hiinhypaw lu kheit san a um ung tou?” a cipya. Ziba nynh siapharan kha, “Janathan ccapaw lu kheit a um ung; aning tuh a ccu akhou,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:4">2Sa 4.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Aning tuh teimou a um?” cite khia zah, Ziba nynh siapharan kha, “Aning tuh Lodebar khua, Ammiel ccapaw Makhir inn kya nynh a um,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />David Siapharan nynh ccungccaw saw zah Lodebar khua, Ammiel ccapaw Makhir inn kya-e amaw kha a kosah hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul ccapaw Jonathan a ccapaw Mefibosheth tuh David kalan yn thua zah bakhungte sawtuanaw a pya. David nynh, “Mefibosheth!” cite ko zah, aning nynh, “Na ryalahtu mang ka um,” cite a khung. <verse number="7" style="v" />David nynh amaw kha, “Rih nan, pawccecize na paaw Jonathan keiccuze na tungvaw thawccinaw kae langsapakuh cih; na minpaaw Saul laephi balyn kha kae kii cih zah, ka ccaboi kya zungzae na ae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning nynh sawtuanaw pya zah, “Kae tahawpaw ui chihpaw hynh nang nynh do lan ciate, na ryalahtu hynh pawmou ka thua?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Saul a ryalahtupaw Ziba kha ko zah, “Saul uccaw balyn te a innbyn hae kya-e balyn kha na bawipaw a mintawpaw kalan ka pya vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang te na ccapaw hae te na ryalahtu hae nynh aning hanlan loo na phopah cih oh zah, na bawipaw a mintawpaw nynh a ae lanpaw looh kha na thuakhaepah cih oh; thuasalama na bawipaw a mintawpaw Mefibosheth tuh ka ccaboi kya zungzae a ae cih,” a cipya. Ziba tuh ccapaw lu haw lae pangaw te ryalahtu lu kuin a hoi. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ziba nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw nynh a ryalahtu kya kaw yn pya thyhte, na ryalahtu kae nynh ka cyih cih,” a cipya. Mefibosheth tuh siapharan ccapaw lu kheit hawte David ccaboi kya looh a ae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mefibosheth nynh Mika cikuhpaw ccapaw taraw lu kheit a hoi. Ziba inn kya um hae paw balyn tuh Mefibosheth ryalahtu lang a tang hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mefibosheth tuh Jerusalem kya a um; pawccecize siapharan ccaboi kya looh zungzae a ae. Aning tuh a ccu voi ning mawte akhou.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ammon hae te Siria hae kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1Sh 19.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute Ammon hae siapharan tuh chih zah, amaw ccelang a ccapaw Hanun tuh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh, “Hanun paaw Nahash nynh ka tungvaw a lungzi hawte, a ccapaw Hanun tungvaw kya lungzite ka ccuepe cih,” a ci. Tukeiccuze David nynh a paaw te asekuh lante lungtangnaw pya khylan locceihtu hae kha a saw hae. David a locceihtu hae tuh Ammon hae ram kya he a thua hae te, <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon ccungccaw hae bawi hae nynh mih bawipaw Hanun kyakhe, “David nynh nang kha lungtangnaw pya khylan locceihtu hae yn saw hae paw hynh na paaw kha sawtuanaw a pyapaw nynh thua cite na tua ccaccing tou? Khua hynh akaw-aleih dote dophi khylan te ro khylan David nynh a locceihtu hae hynh yn saw khyh hae tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Hanun nynh David locceihtu hae kha kyngte mih khawming angankuh kha ccarou ngo hae zah, mih boeining kha angaelung ccepahthua te awpah hae zah ccaring a cciasah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David kya he a hopah hae te, minmin tuh myaryamaw mih maethya keiccuze minmin kha cciadue khylan ccungccaw a saw hae. Te siapharan nynh, “Nae khawming asae mawlaezung Jeriko khua kya la um oh, tukoute nae ki cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ammon hae nynh David kya kae cceikhah vae cipaw he a nyh hae te, Ammon hae nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah Beth-rehob e Siria hae te Zobah e Siria hae, ccu rhawkaw thong kuin, Maakah ram siapharan te a ccungccaw hae thong kheit, Tob ram e ccungccaw thong haw lae ning kha a hoh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David nynh he a thae te, Joab te athungpaw rhawkaw hae balyn kha a saw hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon hae tuh oun pou hae zah koikua teenaw kyakhe rhawtuk lan a um hae; Zobah te Rehob e Siria hae te Tob te Maakah e ccungccaw hae tuh ramkaw khe taekhiate a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab nynh malang te thuasah, nulang te thuasah rhaw yn tuk vae cih hae cipaw he a nyh tuh, Israel hae lungkhu e athung huaccepaw ccungccaw abang kha po hae zah, Siria hae kha tuk khylan a nung hae; <verse number="10" style="v" />tuhlaepaw a ccungccaw hae kha tuh Ammon hae kha tuk khylan a neitawpaw Abishai kuihkaw khe a nung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab nynh, “Siria hae tuh ka hanlan myaryasankae a thung hae ze, nang nynh nae bawm cih; te Ammon hae tuh na hanlan myaryasankae a thung hae ze, kae ccianua cih zah kae bawm cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawthungte um lah, ah ccungccaw hae hanlan te ah Pachia khua hae hanlan rawhoyte um oh sih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahoy a ci thyhte cyih vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Joab te a kya um hae paw tuh Siria hae kha tuk khylan naenuakuh hae zah, mih malang te Siria hae tuh a ccue hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Siria hae a ccue vae hae cipaw kha Ammon hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, minmin mah tuhmaminte Abishai malang te ccue hae zah khua lungkhu lang a tee hae. Te Joab tuh Ammon hae a tuknaw hae kyate yn ki zah Jerusalem yn thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh oun tae vae hae cipaw kha Siria hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, pynkheihlan bua a pumkuh hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Hadadezer nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah Zufrates khuraw lang um hae paw Siria hae kha yn thuakhae hae; Hadadezer a rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawipaw Shobak nynh ukte cciakhae hae zah Helam kya a thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David kya he a hopah hae tuh, aning nynh Israel hae balyn kha pynkheihlan pumte Jordan vaw kha zua hae zah Helam a thua hae. Siria hae tuh David kha rawsete taekhiate um hae zah aning te rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Siria hae tuh Israel hae malang a ccue hae; David nynh Siria hae marangle a ccikuh hae paw za sari te marang rhawkaw thong sung pali kha a chia hae, mih rhawbawipaw Shobak kha tuk zah tuin kya a chih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadadezer a ryalahtu siapharan hae balyn nynh Israel hae nynh oun tae vae hae cipaw he a muih hae tuh, Israel te ccawkunaw rae hae zah mih kuihkaw um hae paw lang a tang hae. Tukeiccuze Siria hae tuh rih hae zah Ammon hae kha bua bawm ngan vae khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Bathsheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hawnin yn thua zah siapharan hae nynh rhawtuknaw lang ccia ccyh he yn thua tuh, David nynh Joab te a kuihkaw e bawi hae te Israel hae balyn kha a saw hae; minmin nynh Ammon hae kha roh hae zah Rabbah khua kha a koihlu hae. Thuasalama David tuh Jerusalem khua kya a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 20:1">1Sh 20.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh zetesang khe David nynh a ikhung kyate thokuh zah siapharan inn innccuvaw kya a ccia bungthung lyakhe, tui singkuhpaw nopinung lu kheit kha innccuvaw kyate a muih; tuh-e nopinung tuh myarya a puithya. <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh tuh-e nopinung kong khiatua khylan ccungccaw saw zah, “Eliam ccanung Bathsheba, Hit minphuinpaw Uriah zu nynh thua,” cite a hopya. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh tuh-e nopinung kha ko khylan locceihtu hae kha a saw hae, te a kalan yn thua zah amaw nynh a ikhae. (Aning tuh nopiny a nyh koute a ccikanku lya nynh thua.) Tukoute nopinung tuh a inn lang a ki. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung tuh ccaaw a poi; te David kalan ccungccaw saw zah, “Ccaaw ka hoi,” cite bya a taw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh Joab kha byataw zah, “Hit minphuinpaw Uriah kha ka kalan yn saw,” a cipya. Te Joab nynh Uriah kha David kalan a saw. <verse number="7" style="v" />Uriah he yn thua tuh, David nynh Joab te ccungccaw hae konglang te rhawtuk konglang kha a khia. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te David nynh Uriah kha, “Na inn lang la cceih lah na ccu la singkuh,” a cipya. Uriah tuh siapharan inn kyate pou zah, a nulang te siapharan nynh lasung a pyasah hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Uriah tuh a inn lang ki leite a bawipaw a ryalahtu hae balyn ryte siapharan inn thuakaw kyakhe a ryabua. <verse number="10" style="v" />“Uriah tuh a inn lang cceih khyh,” cite David kha he a hopah hae tuh, David nynh Uriah kha, “Pawccemou na inn lang na ccia khyh? Khuaccongnaw langte khaw nae thua?” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Uriah nynh David kha, “Byakin thingkua te Israel hae te Judah hae tuh bu kya nynh a um hae; ka bawipaw Joab te ka bawipaw ryalahtu hae tuh ramkaw kya nynh a rya hae; kae tuh ae lan nia lan te ka zu ryte ikheih khylan ka inn lang ka cceih cih zawtou? Nang tuh na hiin thyhte, na hiinnaw mah a hiin thyhte, tuhcihawpaw tuh ka cyih lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te David nynh Uriah kha, “Atunin mah hein kya um hin, awkhualan kae cciasah cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Uriah tuh tuin nin khe Jerusalem kya a um. Awkhualan tuh, <verse number="13" style="v" />David nynh ae khylan te nia khylan a kalan ko zah a ruisah; zete tuh a bawipaw ryalahtu hae ryte ryakheih khylan a pou, thuasalama a inn lang tuh cceih khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">David te Uriah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua tuh David nynh Joab kalan ccaw zei zah Uriah kuih kyate a ky. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccaw kyakhe, “Uriah hynh rhawtuk aso huanaw malang kou khe nung lah, amaw kha tuk hae zah a chi ccaw, nulang na kitaw cih,” cite a zei. <verse number="16" style="v" />Joab nynh khuapi a koihlu lyakhe, mih rawthung hae paw a umnaw hae hmin cite a nynaw kyakhe Uriah kha a nung. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e khuapi kya-e ccungccaw hae tuh oun pou hae zah Joab te a tukkuh hae; tuh-e hae kya-e David a ryalahtu hae abang tuh a chih hae. Hit minphuinpaw Uriah mah a chihbua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Joab nynh ccungccaw saw zah rhawtuknaw konglang thongpang balyn kha David kalan a thaesah; <verse number="19" style="v" />tuh-e locceihtupaw kyakhe, “Rhawtuknaw konglang thongpang balyn kha siapharan kya he na hopah koute, <verse number="20" style="v" />siapharan tuh a thinria zah nang kha, ‘Pawccemou khuapi kalan thawte na naeku oh? Khualungrua kyate oun kaw cih hae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusbbaal ccapaw Abimelek kha hum nynh mou a theih? Nopinung lu kheit nynh sungmia-lung avawlan e khate khualungrua kyate sawphu zah Thebez khua kya chih khyh tou? Pawccemou khualungrua kalan thawte na naeku oh?’ ae cipya ze, nang nynh, ‘Na ryalahtupaw Hit minphuinpaw Uriah mah a chih,’ cite na la hopah cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:53">Bpt 9.53</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze locceihtupaw tuh cceih zah Joab nynh ho lan a tawpaw bya balyn kha David kya a hopya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Locceihtupaw nynh David kha, “Rhaw hae nynh oun tae hae zah, ramkaw khe oun pounua hae; thuasalama khua koikua teenaw kyacia bua kae dee hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh thekawthya hae paw nynh na ryalahtupaw kha khualungrua kyate a kaw hae; siapharan na ryalahtu hae abang tuh a chih hae; te na ryalahtupaw, Hit minphuinpaw Uriah mah a chihbua,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />David nynh locceihtupaw kha, “Joab kyakhe, ‘E uccaw keiccuze na lungriathae nan sah, pawccecize thaloi nynh tuh atu lu kheit, tukoute lu kheit cite chia phungpaw nynh thua; khuapi kha thawte tuk oh lah, roh oh,’ a ci cite thawpyanaw bya na la hopah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uriah zu nynh a vawpaw a chih vae cipaw kha he a nyh tuh, rawkhuite a um. <verse number="27" style="v" />He a rah koute, David nynh ccungccaw sawte a inn lang kosah hae zah a zu lang a tang, te ccapaw lu kheit a saahpya. Thuasalama David a cyisahnaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a lunghoysah khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nathan nynh David Sei A Be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh profeh Nathan kha David kalan a saw. Aning nynh David kha, “Khua khuakheit kya ccungccaw lu ning a um hae, lu kheit tuh mihoipaw thua zah ccangpaw lu kheit tuh ryachipaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51">Sam 51</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihoipaw nynh tuuphu te vaetua phu patae a hoi; <verse number="3" style="v" />ryachipaw nynh tuh a rekupaw tuu nopi taraw sa kheit laelan pawpaw mah hoilae vae khyh. Tuh-e tuu nopi taraw tuh ryachipaw nynh kuakuh zah amaw ryte, a ccaaw hae ryte a lethung kheih hae; aning nynh ryachipaw looh kha leih ae zah a banang kya-e kha leih a neih, ryachipaw by vaw kya leih ih zah a ccanung hawte nynh athua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te mihoipaw kalan khe mikhia lu kheit yn thua zah mihoipaw nynh a kalan yn thuapaw mikhiapaw tuh aepaw paccynpya khylan amaw tuuphu kya-e te vaetua phu kya-e kha chiapya lan a hysah khyh keiccuze, ryachipaw kya-e tuutaw kha lah zah, a kalan yn thuapaw mikhiapaw kha aepaw a paccynpya,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />David nynh tuh-e mihoipaw tungvaw myaryamaw a thinria zah Nathan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, tuhte a cyihtupaw tuh chi lan accan; <verse number="6" style="v" />tuhte a cyi keiccu thuasah, ngaethya a umsah khyh keiccu thuasah tuutaw tuh leit pali a pyaru cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nathan nynh David kha, “Tuh-e paw tuh namaw nynh na thua! Israel Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang kha Israel uktu siapharan lang chitui kae thuh zah Saul kuih kyate kae luesah; <verse number="8" style="v" />na bawipaw inn te na bawipaw zu hae kha na by kya kae pya, Israel ciihan te Judah ciihan kha kae pya; e hae hynh eih azya ung ze, bua kae pyachih ung cih. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw rae khylan pawccemou a bya kha pawlang na ria khyh? Hit ccungccaw Uriah kha thaloi te na theih zah a zu kha na zu lang na lawku, aning kha Ammon hae thaloi te na chia. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae kha pawlang nae ria khyh zah Hit ccungccaw Uriah zu kha na zu lang na lawku keiccuze na ciihan kyate thaloi tuh papin phiakuh lan khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Namaw ciihan lungkhu toulou kyate na tungvaw kya vawsawnaw ka langsakuh cih; na zu hae kha na muihnaw kyate ka lah cih hae zah na innpaw kalan ka pya cih, e khuanin nynh a muihnaw ccaccei kyakhe aning nynh minmin kha a ikhae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:22">2Sa 16.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize nang nynh e uccaw hynh aruh lante na cyi; thuasalama kae nynh tuh Israel hae balyn malang te khuanin malang khe ka cyih cih,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />David nynh Nathan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw ka sei vae,” a cipya. Nathan nynh David kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na seinaw kha ae vuapya vae, na chih lan khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama tuhcite na cyisahnaw liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha myaryamaw pawlang na ria khyh keiccuze na saahkupaw ccaaw tuh a chih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Nathan tuh a inn lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bathsheba Ccaaw A Chih</para>
  <para style="p">Uriah zu nynh David a saahpyapaw ccaaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh detah zah myarya a ccih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh imua hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a ngia; David tuh looh-aesungte alungkhu lang tee zah azi zidae laekhu kya a toukuh. <verse number="17" style="v" />A innbyn kya-e piccan hae nynh laekhu kyate a thoku nawlan soihbia hae zah a pe a thadynnua hae; thuasalama tho ry khyh, minmin ryte looh mah ae ry khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nin sarinaw nin khe imua tuh a chih. David a ryalahtu hae nynh imua a chih vae cipaw hopya lan a rih hae; pawccecize minmin nynh, “Imua a hiin lya heize ah hopah oh zah oun ngaepah khyh; atu imua a chih vae cipaw kha pawtemou ah hopah ngan cih oh? Amaw toulou kha vawsawnaw a pyakuh sei cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama a ryalahtu hae nynh tarytary a hoku hae paw kha David nynh he a thae tuh, imua a chih vae cipaw a ny; te David nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Imua tuh a chih vae tou?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “A chih vae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh David tuh laekhu kyate thokuh zah tui a singkuh, chitui thuhkuh zah a boeining a liakuh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang cceih zah a beik; te a inn lang cciate aepaw ngiakuh hae zah aepaw kha paccynpah hae zah a ae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te a ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kha, “Na cyipaw hynh pawtemou athua? Imua a hiin lya tuh imua hanlan looh-ae na sung zah na rah; imua he a chih tuh, na thokuh zah looh na ae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh, “Imua a hiin lya tuh looh-ae ka sung zah ka rah; pawccecize, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thaw yn ccih zah imua tuh a hiin kho ung khaw, hummou a nyh?’ ka ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama atu imua tuh a chih vae; pawccemou looh-ae ka sung ung cih? Bua ka hiinsah kho ung cih zawtou? Kae tuh a kalan ka cceih cih, thuasalama aning tuh ka kalan yn ki vae lan khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon A Pui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te David nynh a zu Bathsheba kha lungtangnaw a pya, a kalan cceih zah a ikhae; te Bathsheba nynh ccapaw saah zah David nynh Solomon cite min a phu. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha sungsah zah, <verse number="25" style="v" />profeh Nathan kyate bya a taw; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a sungsah keiccuze Jedidiah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jedidiah: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh Bawipaw nynh a sungsahpaw cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ammon hae kha A Chia hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:1-3">1Sh 20.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joab nynh Ammon hae khua Rabbah kha tuk zah siapharan khuapi kha a law. <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab nynh David kalan locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Rabbah khua kha ka tuk vae; tuhpiaze tui alungnaw khua kha ka law vae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kha pumte khua kha ryahmin tahnuakuh lah, lawtua; tuhkhyhze tuh kamaw nynh khuapi kha ka lah cih zah, ka min te khua kha ko athua vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh ccungccaw balyn kha pynkheihlan pumte Rabbah khua lang cceih zah khua kha tuk zah a law. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih siapharan kya-e bawilukhung kha a lu kyate poh a khyh; tuh-e lukhung tuh sui talent ccangkheit ri zah, a lungkhu khe aphutepaw lung a um; tuh-e tuh David lu kya a khungsah hae. Aning nynh khua lungkhu e luadepaw uccaw kha mah myarya lung lan a law. <verse number="31" style="v" />Khua lungkhu um hae paw ccungccaw hae kha poukhae hae zah thing-aw, sivaw muinzung te sivaw hae khate rya a lawsah hae, ohkhe ruanaw kya mah rya a lawsah hae. Tuhcite Ammon hae kya-e khua hae balyn tungvaw kya a cyi hae. Te David te a ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Jerusalem lang a ki hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Amnon te Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccyh tuh sya aro vae. David ccapaw Absalom nynh Tamar cikuhpaw apuithyapaw ccianung lu kheit a hoi; David ccapaw Amnon nynh Tamar kha a sungsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Amnon tuh a ccianung Tamar keiccuze a lungria myarya thae zah amaw te amaw kha a ccisaku, pawccecize aning tuh liaccady thua zah a tungvaw hankhakheit cyi lanpaw kha Amnon elang thua kho khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Amnon nynh Jonadab cikuhpaw ruiban lu kheit hoi zah, aning tuh David a upaw Shimeah ccapaw nynh thua; Jonadab tuh myarya athyaruhpaw ccungccaw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh Amnon kha, “Pou siapharan ccapaw, pawccemou nin kheit koute nin kheit na mitsung houhouh khu? Nae hopah lan khyh tou?” a cipya. Amnon nynh, “Ka neitaw Absalom ccianung Tamar kha ka sungsah,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonadab nynh amaw kha, “Na ikhung kya huekuh lah, ccisakuh nyn; na paaw nynh nang do lan he yn thua te, ‘Ka ccianung Tamar kha ka kalan yn cceih sah lah, ae lanpaw looh yn pya sah, aepaw yn hyngpyapaw kha ka muih zah a kuih kya-e kha ka ae ccaw, ka muihnaw kyahin aepaw yn paccynpah sah,’ cite na hopah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Amnon tuh huekuh zah a ccisaku nyn; siapharan nynh Amnon kha do lan he yn thua tuh, Amnon nynh siapharan kha, “Ka ccianung Tamar kha beih yn cceih sah, a kuih kya-e kha ka ae ccaw, ka muihnaw kyahin sanlou phe ning kha beih yn raepah sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te David nynh Tamar inn lang ccungccaw saw zah, “Na raeepaw Amnon inn lang la cceih lah, aepaw la hynpah,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Tamar tuh a raeepaw Amnon inn lang cceih zah Amnon tuh a la huekuh. Tamar nynh vaekhui kha lah zah a non koute a muihnaw khe sanlou lang rae zah a rua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te talyng-ang kha lah zah Amnon malang khe a nungpya, thuasalama ae lan a mya. Amnon nynh, “Ka kyate ccungccaw miakaw pou hae sah,” a ci. Tukeiccuze a kyate ccungccaw miakaw a pou hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Amnon nynh Tamar kha, “Na kuih kya-e kha ka ae ccaw, looh kha akhaan lungkhu lang yn ccyng,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Tamar nynh a raepyapaw sanlou kha lah zah a raeepaw Amnon kalan akhaan lungkhu lang a teekhae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A ae ccaw cite a kalan he a naekuh tuh, Amnon nynh Tamar kha kyng zah, “Rang, ka kya yn itua, ka ccianung,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamar nynh, “Thua khyh, ka raeepaw, yn nangse nan; pawccecize hynhcihawpaw hynh Israel hae kya cyih boi khyh hae; e anungsikuhpaw hynh cyih nan! <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae ka hanlan te, ka maethyanaw hynh teilangmou ka cciakhae kho cih? Te namaw hanlan te mah, Israel hae kya a ccouseikuhpaw lu kheit hawte na thua cih. Tukeiccuze siapharan kha hopya tua cite kae ngia; pawccecize nang te umkheih lanpaw hynh yn khee lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Amnon nynh ngaepah khyh; aning tuh Tamar laeze a thawsaehua keiccuze kyngde zah a ikhae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Amnon nynh Tamar tuh myaryamaw bua a hua; langmawlya a la sungsahnaw laeze a huanaw tuh alehua vae. Amnon nynh amaw kha, “Thokuh lah cceih ccavae!” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Tamar nynh amaw kha, “Thua khyh, ka raeepaw; kae nae deepaw hynh-e cyiseinaw hynh ka tungvaw kya ccangpaw na cyipaw laeze alehua,” a cipya. Thuasalama Amnon nynh ngaepah khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />A ryalahpaw ccangvaepaw kha ko zah, “E nopinung hynh ka malang te pousah lah, thuakaw kha tou,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />(Aning nynh angkiccua kuihsae kha a kiku; pawccecize langmaw lyaze siapharan ccanung liaccady hae nynh tuhcite leih a kiku hae.) Tukeiccuze a ryalahtupaw nynh amaw kha a pousah koute thuakaw kha a tou. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Tamar nynh a lu vawlan buhhaw phingkuh zah a kikupaw angkiccua kha a seii; a lu vawlan a kuih khang zah a cceih, a cceih lalia lante thawte a siabia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A raeepaw Absalom nynh amaw kha, “Na raeepaw Amnon nynh ae ikhae vosi? Ka ccianung, daebabi lan zya um vae ii; aning tuh na raeepaw nynh thua; e hynh na thinlung kya ccyke nan,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Tamar tuh a raeepaw Absalom inn khe daebabi lan lanmete zya a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />E kong balyn hynh David Siapharan nynh he a thae tuh, myarya a thinria, thuasalama a ccapaw Amnon tuh a ccatawccaw athua keiccuze myarya sungsah zah detah khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Absalom nynh Amnon kya bya hoypaw thuasah, bya thahpaw thuasah ho khyh; pawccecize Amnon nynh a ccianung Tamar kha a ikhaede keiccuze Absalom nynh Amnon kha a hua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom nynh Amnon A Liaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum ning accing koute, Efraim khua pe umpaw Baal-hazor kyakhe Absalom nynh tuuming ngo poi kha tua zah siapharan ccapaw hae balyn kha a ko hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Absalom nynh siapharan kalan cceih zah, “Na ryalahtupaw nynh tuuming ngo poi kha ka tua; siapharan te na ryalahtu hae nynh ka kalan beih oun cceih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Absalom kha, “Thua khyh, ka ccapaw, kae balynte kae cceih nan sah, na hanlan phupaw ripaw lang kae tangsei cih,” a cipya. Absalom nynh palei a soihbia, siapharan nynh a ccia khyh zemah hythuanaw tuh a pya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Absalom nynh, “Namaw na thua khyh ze, ka unopaw Amnon tuh yn cceih sah,” a cipya. Siapharan nynh, “Pawccemou aning tuh na kalan yn cceih cih?” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama Amnon te siapharan ccapaw hae balyn tuh a kalan a cciasah makhia hae, Absalom nynh siapharan kha a soihbia. Absalom nynh siapharan poi hawte a paccyn. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Absalom nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Amnon tuh misutui neih zah a lung he yn paw te, phang ngaw oh lah, kae nynh, ‘Amnon kha theih oh,’ cite he kae hopah oh te, aning kha na theih cih oh. Rih nan oh; kamaw ccaccei nynh kaw kae pya oh paw thua khyh tou? Nae rawthung sah lah, nae rawhoy sah,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Absalom nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte, Absalom a ryalahtu hae nynh a cyi hae. Tetuh siapharan ccapaw hae balyn tuh thokuh hae zah mih lann raveih kha ccikute a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Laanryng a um lya hae khe, Absalom nynh siapharan ccapaw hae balyn kha pong a chia hae, lu kheit san hiin khyh hae, cite David kha a thaesah hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Siapharan tuh thokuh zah a boeining seiikute laekhu kya a huekuh; a ryalahtu hae balyn tuh mih boeining seiikute a pe a thadyn hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />David a upaw Shimeah ccapaw Jonadab nynh, “Siapharan ccapaw hae ccangvae hae balyn kha a chia hae, cite ka bawipaw nynh tua nan; Amnon makhae nynh a chih. Amnon nynh a ccianung Tamar kha a ikhaede nin kyate e ryalaw hynh Absalom nynh a paccynku vae paw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan ccapaw hae balyn tuh a chih vae hae cite siapharan ka bawipaw nynh na thinlung kya tua nan; pawccecize Amnon makhae nynh a chih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Absalom tuh a ccue. Rhawviatu ccangvaepaw nynh ngawdo zah, mua zong e Horonaim laanpi kya ccungccaw patae oun cceih hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="35" style="v" />Jonadab nynh siapharan kha, “Dotua, siapharan ccapaw hae oun cceih vae hae; na ryalahtupaw nynh ka ho hawte, akyh vae,” a cipya. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te he a ho koute, siapharan ccapaw hae tuh oun thua hae zah mih roisawte a rah hae; siapharan te a ryalahtu hae balyn mah thawmawte a rah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Absalom tuh ccue zah, Geshur siapharan Ammihud ccapaw Talmai kalan a cceih. David tuh a ccapaw elang nin takyh a rah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:3">2Sa 3.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v" />Absalom tuh Geshur lang ccue zah kum thum a um. <verse number="39" style="v" />David siapharan tuh Amnon a chinaw konglang te lungtangnaw a hoi vae keiccuze a lungdae vae zah Absalom kha a ngae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem lang Absalom A Ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siapharan thinlung tuh Absalom kya nynh a um cipaw kha Zeruiah ccapaw Joab nynh a ny. <verse number="2" style="v" />Joab nynh Tekoa lang ccungccaw saw zah ahawpaw nopinung kha a kosah. Joab nynh nopinung kha, “Michi elang a ngaethahpaw hawte umsaku nyn tua; chitui thuhku leite michi chi lya lawkupaw boeining kha lawkuh lah, michi elang khaw cia a rah vae paw nopinung hawte umsaku tua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan kalan cceih lah, hynhte na hopah cih,” a cipya. Te a ho lanpaw bya kha Joab nynh a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tekoa khua e nopinung nynh siapharan kalan he a thua te, laekhu kya bakhungte sawtuanaw pya zah, “Pou siapharan, beih yn bawmtua!” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Pawmou na vawsaw?” cite a khia. Nopinung nynh, “Thanccingte, kae tuh nomaenung nynh ka thua; ka vawpaw nynh yn chitaw vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ryalahtunung nynh ccapaw lu ning ka hoi zah ramkaw kya a ziakuh hae; a phiatu lu kheit san a um khyh keiccuze lu kheit nynh lu kheit kha zia zah phe a chia. <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu tuh ka puizia hae balyn nynh na ryalahtunung hynh yn thonuakuh hae zah, ‘A unopaw a theihtupaw kha oun pya, a unopaw hiinnaw kha a chia keiccuze amaw kha kae theihru cih, a rho kha heize kae roh cih,’ a ci hae. Tuhcite a laehy ungpaw ka maee-e ccangkheit kha minmin nynh a the cih hae zah, ka vawpaw hanlan min thuasah, a laehypaw kha thuasah laephi vawlan te a zosah vae cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh nopinung kha, “Na inn lang la cceih, nang te asekuh lante kaw ka tho cih,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tekoa khua e nopinung nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, seinaw tuh kae te ka paaw ciihan kya ccah vae sah; siapharan te a bawitungkhung kya seinaw um nan sah,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Lukhakheit nynh hankhakheit ae hopya ze, ka kalan yn ko lah, aning nynh nang kha bua ae ty vae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh, “Chiise phulahtu nynh a chia vae khyh nawlan te ka ccapaw tuh chia athua khyh nawlan, siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha na lung kya beih ccyke tua,” a cipya. Siapharan nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, na ccapaw sangrua ccangkheit sanmah laekhu lang khuakuh lan khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh, “Na ryalahtunung nynh siapharan ka bawipaw kha bya kaw kheit beih kae hopya tua sah,” cipah zah, aning nynh, “Hotua,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nopinung nynh, “Athua lanze, Pachia ccungccaw hae kha rawsete hynhcihawpaw uccaw hynh pawccemou na paccyn? Pawccecize siapharan nynh hynh-e byapaenaw a raenaw kyahin, siapharan nynh a deepaw lu kheit kha inn lang bua a kisah khyh keiccuze amaw toulou kha bya a piaku vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aening balyn tuh ah chih cih oh; laekhu kya tui alaekuhpaw suelua kho leipaw te nynh ah aloku oh. Thuasalama Pachia nynh ccungccaw hiinnaw kha ccaring lah lan khyh; dee vae paw ccungccaw kha Pachia nynh a muihnaw kyate zungzae dee athua khyh nawlan a paccyn mamin cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh ka thin yn phangsah hae keiccuze e hynh siapharan ka bawipaw kha hopya lan kae cceih; na ryalahtunung nynh, ‘Siapharan kha ka hopah cih; a ryalahtunung nynh ka ngiapaw hynh siapharan nynh poh yn cyipah kho vosi. <verse number="16" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a thae cih zah, Pachia rho lungkhu te kae te ka ccapaw parouh mawte oun roh cih paw ccungccapaw kuih kyate a ryalahtunung hynh yn luesah cih,’ cite a tua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ryalahtunung nynh, ‘Siapharan ka bawipaw bya nynh kae kha ngaengannaw yn pya cih,’ a ci; siapharan ka bawipaw tuh Pachia vaawpaw hawte athya te ahoy phiathyanaw a hoi. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh na kya um vae sah!” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:27">2Sa 19.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh nopinung kha, “Nang kae khiapaw bya miakaw hynh yn phei nan,” a cipya. Nopinung nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, yn hotua,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “E konglang balyn kyahin Joab nynh tuanaw ae pya tou?” cite a khia. Nopinung nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, nang tuh na hiin thyhte, siapharan ka bawipaw nynh na ho vae paw bya miakaw kha lukhakheit nynh voilang thuasah, ranglang thuasah mae kho lan khyh. Kaw yn pyatu tuh na ryalahtu Joab nynh thua; aning nynh e bya balyn hynh na ryalahtunung kha yn hopah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Uccaw acyikuzia hynh paleih khylan na ryalahtu Joab nynh e hynh a cyih. Thuasalama ka bawipaw tuh laephi vawlan a umpaw uccaw balyn kha ny nawlan Pachia vaawpaw kya-e hawnaw alopaw hawnaw kha na hoi,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Joab kha, “Myarya hoy, e hynh ka ua; cceih lah, ccangvaepaw Absalom kha yn kikhae,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Joab tuh laekhu kya bakhung zah sawtuanaw pyate siapharan kha hythua a pya; te Joab nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, na ryalahtupaw nynh kae ngiapaw kha siapharan nynh nae ua keiccuze na malang maehoynaw ka mue vae cipaw kha na ryalahtupaw nynh atunin ka ny,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joab tuh thokuh zah Geshur lang cceih zah Absalom kha Jerusalem lang a hoei. <verse number="24" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Amaw inn lang cceih sah; ka umnaw lang yn cceih nan sah,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Absalom tuh amaw inn lang cceih zah siapharan a umnaw lang cceih khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Absalom A Ngaethya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel hae balyn kya Absalom hawte a puithyanaw kya thehoysah lanpaw lu kheit san um khyh. A ccuphe kyate a lu kya-e bawilukhung kyacia ccaenaw um khyh. <verse number="26" style="v" />A sang a ngoku vae ze, a sang kha tounawpaw te leih tou zah siapharan kya-e tounawpaw te shekel za ning acih, (kum takyh kum thang khe leih a ngokuh; a sang eih ari vae ze leih a ngokuh). <verse number="27" style="v" />Absalom nynh ccapaw lu thum te a min Tamar cikuhpaw ccanung lu kheit a saah; aning tuh myarya puithyapaw nopi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Absalom tuh Jerusalem kya siapharan a umnaw lang thua leite kum ning phe ccing lan a um. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan kalan yn saw ccaw cite Absalom nynh Joab kalan ccungccaw saw zah, Joab tuh yn thua khyh. Vae ningnaw ccungccaw saw zahmah yn thua lae khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh Absalom nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Dotua oh, Joab loo tuh ka loo pe um zah barli a hoi; la cceih oh lah, maee te la soi oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Absalom a ryalahtu hae nynh a loo kha maee te a soi hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Joab nynh thokuh zah Absalom kha a inn lang ccianua zah, “Pawccemou na ryalahtu hae nynh ka loo kha maee yn soipya hae?” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Absalom nynh Joab kha, “Dotua, nang kha bya kae taw zah: Hynhlang yn cciatua, ‘Pawccemou Geshur kyate kae ccia? Khuing kya maw po ka la um ze kamaw elang ahoyhua,’ cite byakhia khylan siapharan kalan kae saw cih, kae cipya. Atu siapharan a umnaw lang yn cciasah; ka cyiseinaw a um ze, yn theih sah!” a cipya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Joab nynh siapharan kalan cceih zah a hopya; te siapharan nynh Absalom kha a ko. Te siapharan kalan cceih zah siapharan malang laekhu khe a bakhung; te siapharan nynh Absalom kha a myng.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Absalom nynh David A Rawse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute Absalom nynh marangle ccangkheit, marang hae te a malang a ccuety lanpaw ccungccaw sung pangaw kha a paccyn hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Absalom tuh awkhua takaw te leih tho zah koikua kalan ccianaw laanpi pe khe leih a thadyn; te lukhakheit nynh a byathan kha byapiaku khylan siapharan malang a thuakhae ze, Absalom nynh ko zah, “Nang hynh tei khuapaw mou na thua?” cite leih a khia. Tuh-e paw nynh, “Na ryalahtu tuh Israel ram kya-e tuh phin khah phin nynh ka thua,” cite he a khung vae ze, <verse number="3" style="v" />Absalom nynh, “Dotua, na bya tuh hoy zah akyh; thuasalama na byathan ngaepya khylan siapharan nynh a nawpaw ccungccaw um khyh,” cite leih a hopya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Absalom nynh, “E ram kya byapiatu lang ka tang ravo nyn! Kaethekunaw bya te byathan a hoipaw balyn nynh ka kalan oun cceih cih hae zah, hmerarih lan bya ka piapah cih hae,” cite leih a ho. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh sawtuanaw pya khylan amaw kalan a naeku vae hae ze, a kuih kha leih dyng zah leih a myng hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Byapiaku khylan siapharan kalan oun cceih hae paw Israel hae miakaw kha Absalom nynh tuhcite leih a cyi hae; tukeiccuze Absalom nynh Israel ccungccaw hae thinlung kha a ru hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum pali aro koute, Absalom nynh siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya bya ka kinkupaw kha ccingsah khylan Hebron khua lang ccianaw kaw beih yn pya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize na ryalahtu nynh Siria ram Geshur khua ka um lyaze byakinkunaw ccangkheit ka rae zah: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerusalem lang yn cciakhae ccaccing zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha Hebron khua kya ka beik cih, ka la ci,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Ngaengante la cceih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze thokuh zah Hebron lang a cceihthung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Absalom nynh Israel phin hae balyn kalan khe locceihtu hae kha aruh lante saw hae zah, “Mungkae roi ccahe na thae oh te, ‘Absalom tuh Hebron khua kya siapharan lang a tang vae!’ cite na sia cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Absalom nynh a ko hae paw ccungccaw za ning tuh Jerusalem kyate a cceih hae; tuh-e hae tuh pawningkhua ny leite, thinlung thyaararihte a cceih hae paw nynh thua hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Absalom nynh silawnaw a rae cciamang lyakhe, Giloh khua lang ccungccaw saw zah David kya-e tuanaw pyatu, Gilon minphuinpaw Ahithofel kha a kosah hae. Tuh-e aruh lante khuakhannaw tuh thawzung houhouh hoi zah Absalom a zuipaw ccungccaw hae tuh houhouh a lungchih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem te David A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Locceihtu lu kheit tuh David kalan yn thua zah, “Israel hae thinlung tuh Absalom nulang nynh a zuiku vae,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh Jerusalem kya a umkheih hae paw a kuihkaw e bawi hae balyn kha, “Thoku oh! Ccue oh sih, tuhkhyhze tuh Absalom kuih kyate ah lue vae lan khyh oh. Rangsakuh oh, tuhkhyhze tuh aning nynh aro mawze oun phah cih zah, ah tungvaw kya ronaw thuakhaete khuapi hynh thaloi te a bae vae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan kae bawipaw nynh bya na paepaw miakaw kha na ryalahtu hae nynh cyi lan paccynkute kae um,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan tuh thokuh zah a innbyn hae balyn nynh a zui hae; tuhzemah a lovaenung hae lu haw kha tuh inn do-oih khylan a cciatawsya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan te a ccungccaw hae balyn tuh pou hae zah, innte lang kou umpaw inn kyakhe a haeung hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />A kuihkaw e bawi hae balyn tuh a kya a zuikuh hae; Khereth hae balyn, Peleth hae balyn te Gath khua kyate amaw a zui hae paw Git minphuin za taruh hae balyn tuh siapharan malang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Git minphuinpaw Ittai kha, “Pawccemou nang hynh kae kya na cciabua? La ki lah, siapharan ryte la um oh; pawccecize nang tuh ramccangpaw na thua zah, na inn kyate a ccuepaw mah na thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Inkhawnin dede nae thua zah, atunin kaemaw ryte kae vaevuisah bua cih tou? Teilang ccia lan cipaw san ka nykuh khyh. La ki lah, na puizia hae mah la kikhae hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh atynpaw sungsahnaw te a lungzinaw kha ae la muihsah vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama Ittai nynh siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, siapharan ka bawipaw mah a hiin thyhte, siapharan ka bawipaw a umnaw takyh kya, chi zemah hiin zemah, tuin kyakhe na ryalahtupaw mah ka umbua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh Ittai kha, “Athua lanze, po cceih ccaleih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Git minphuinpaw Ittai tuh a ccungccaw hae balyn ryte, te amaw kya um hae paw imua hae balyn ryte po a cceih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />David a zui hae paw balyn tuh a ccia hae keiccuze ram pynpi tuh thawte a rah; siapharan nynh Kidron vaw kha zua zah, ccungccaw balyn tuh ramkaw langkhe a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abiathar tuh yn thua zah, Zadok mah Levi hae balyn ryte Pachia byakin thingkua kha puihte oun thua hae. Ccungccaw hae tuh khua lungkhu te pong a pou kou makhia hae, Pachia thingkua kha laekhu khe a nung hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Zadok kha, “Pachia thingkua kha khua lungkhu lang la kikhae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh, aning nynh bua yn kikhae cih zah, e thingkua te thingkua a umnaw hmin kha yn muihsah cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh, ‘Na tungvaw ka lungrythua khyh,’ a ci lanze, kae tuh hein kya mang ka um, ahoy a ci thyhte ka tungvaw cyih vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ranpibawi Zadok kha, “Dotua, daebabi lan khua lungkhu langkhe, nang te Abiathar tuh, nae ccapaw hae lu ning, namaw ccapaw Ahimaaz te Abiathar ccapaw Jonathan ryte la ki oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Dotua, nanning kyate ka kalan thaesah lanpaw bya yn thua mawlaezung ramkaw e vawkhu zuanaw kyakhe ka la ngaw cih,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Zadok te Abiathar nynh Pachia thingkua kha Jerusalem langkhe kikhae hae zah, tuin kya a umsya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />David tuh raw biate, a lu bongkute a ccu ccakaete Oliv Mua langkhe a kaethung; amaw kya um hae paw balyn tuh raw biate mih lu bongkute a kaethung hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahithofel tuh aruh lante khuakhantu hae kyakhe Absalom ryte a umkheih hae cipaw kha David kya a hopya hae. Te David nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Ahithofel nynh a pyapaw tuanaw kha ngaeenaw lang tangsah tua, cite na kalan saw ka sang,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">David kya-e Dophitu Hushai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David tuh Pachia a beiknaw hae mua dung kya he a thua tuh, Arkhi phin athuapaw Hushai tuh a angkile seiikute, a lu kya laephi phingkute David kha tungku khylan yn cceih. <verse number="33" style="v" />David nynh, “Nang tuh ka kya na cciabua ze, ka hanlan phupaw ripaw lang na tang cih. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama khua lungkhu lang na cceih zah Absalom kha, ‘Pou siapharan, na ryalahtu lang ka tang cih; langmawlya na paaw ryalahtu lang ka la tang hawte, atu tuh na ryalahtu lang ka tang vae cih,’ cite na hopya lanze, Ahithofel nynh a pyapaw tuanaw kha nae taepah kho cih. <verse number="35" style="v" />Ranpibawi Zadok te Abiathar tuh khua lungkhu kya nang ryte a um hae. Tukeiccuze siapharan inn e na thaepaw miakaw kha ranpibawi Zadok te Abiathar kha hopah hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Mih ccapaw hae lu ning, Zadok ccapaw Ahimaaz te Abiathar ccapaw Jonathan tuh minmin ryte a umkheih hae; na thaepaw miakaw kha minmin kyate nae thaesah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Absalom nynh Jerusalem lang he a tee lyakhe, David banpaw Hushai tuh khua lungkhu lang a tee.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David Rhaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh mua dung kha hary he a lawe tuh, Mefibosheth a ryalahtupaw Ziba nynh khungnin dekuhpaw lann sa ning ryte sanlou aphe za ning, misu thae aroupaw ange za kheit, hawnin thingthae za kheit te misutui saving tui-ung ccangkheit kha phu zah David kha a cciadue.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:9-10">2Sa 9.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Ziba kha, “E hae hynh pawccemou nae phu?” cite khia zah, Ziba nynh, “Lann hae hynh siapharan innbyn hae a cciku lan hae thua zah, sanlou te hawnin thingthae hynh ccangvae hae nynh a ae lan hae, te misutui hynh ramkaw kya mih thawbangpaw nynh a nia lan hae paw nynh thua,” cite a khung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Na bawipaw ccapaw teimou a um?” cite khia zah, Ziba nynh siapharan kha, “Jerusalem kya nynh a um, pawccecize aning nynh, ‘Atunin Israel hae nynh ka paaw peenaw kha yn pyathui cih hae,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:26-27">2Sa 19.26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Ziba kha, “Mefibosheth kya-e balyn tuh na kya-e nynh athua vae,” a cipya. Ziba nynh, “Sawtuanaw kae pya; siapharan ka bawipaw, na malang maehoynaw ka mue vae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shimei nynh David kha Thya A Law</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David Siapharan tuh Bahurim kya he a thua te, Saul puizia athuapaw Gera ccapaw, a min Shimei cikuhpaw tuh thya a lawbia lalia lante yn pou. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh David Siapharan te a ryalahtu hae balyn kha lung te a deih hae; ccungccaw balyn te athungpaw ccungccaw hae balyn tuh a voilang te a ranglang khe a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thya a law lalia lante Shimei nynh, “Pou! Pou! Ccungccaw theihpaw! Ccungccaw thyapaw! <verse number="8" style="v" />A peenaw na luapaw Saul ciihan chiise balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh namaw tungvaw a ccawsah vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh peenaw kha na ccapaw Absalom kuih kya a pya vae. Dotua, nang tuh chiise luasahtu na thua keiccuze na ronaw tuh na tungvaw accah vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh Zeruiah ccapaw Abishai nynh siapharan kha, “E ui chihpaw nynh siapharan ka bawipaw kha pawccemou thya a law cih? Kae ccianua sah lah, a lu khuh thoh kae pae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan nynh, “Nanning Zeruiah ccapaw hae, nanning tuh kae te pawmou asekuh? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning tuh, ‘David kha thyalaw,’ a cipya keiccuze aning nynh kae kha thya yn lawpaw a la thua lanze, hum nynh mou amaw kha, ‘Pawccemou hynhte na cyi?’ cite a hopah kho cih?” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />David nynh Abishai te a ryalahtu hae balyn kha, “Ka ccapaw toulou nynh ka hiinnaw hynh yn ccung; e Benjamin phin hae thathy nynh tuh houh yn ccung hae ngawrei! Amaw um lan um sah lah, thya yn law ccaleih sah; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a nawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka riathaenaw kha yn muihpah cih zah, atunin thya yn lawnaw hanlan hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hoynaw kha poh yn pyaru kho,” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te a ccungccaw hae tuh laanpi kya cceih hae zah, Shimei tuh David te arawsekunaw mua azoubungnaw kya a cceih lalia lante David kha thya a lawbia, lung te a deih bia, vuiping te mah a hei bia. <verse number="14" style="v" />Siapharan te a kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn tuh thawbangte Jordan vaw a thua hae; tuin kyakhe David tuh a thaw bua a umsakuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahithofel kya-e Tuanaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Absalom te Israel hae balyn tuh Jerusalem thua hae zah, Ahithofel tuh amaw kya a umbua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Arki phin Hushai, David a banpaw nynh Absalom kya he a thua te, Hushai nynh Absalom kha, “Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah! Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom nynh Hushai kha, “E hynh na banpaw tungvaw lungzinaw na hoipaw tou athua? Pawccemou na banpaw kya na cciabua khyh?” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Hushai nynh Absalom kha, “Thua khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te e ccungccaw hae te Israel hae balyn nynh a po vae hae paw ccungccapaw kya-e ka thua cih zah, amaw kya ka umbua cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, hum rya mou ka lah cih? A ccapaw rya kha thua khyh tou? Na paaw rya kha ka la law hawte namaw rya kha ka lah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Absalom nynh Ahithofel kha, “Na tuanaw kha kaening oun pyatua; pawtemou ah cyih cih oh?” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahithofel nynh Absalom kha, “Inn ngawtu lang na paaw nynh a nungsya hae paw a lovaenung hae kha la ikhae hae; te na paaw nynh nang kha ae hua vae cipaw tuh Israel hae balyn nynh a thae cih hae zah, na kya um hae paw balyn tuh mih thaw houh asae vae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze innccuvaw khe Absalom elang bu kha a dawpya hae; te Israel hae balyn nynh a muihnaw hae khe Absalom nynh a paaw lovaenung hae kha a ikhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:11-12">2Sa 12.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh Ahithofel nynh a pyapaw tuanaw kha Pachia bya ccaccei hawmawte a tua hae; tuhcite Ahithofel kya-e tuanaw pyanaw kha David te Absalom nynh saw a tua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Ahithofel nynh Absalom kyakhe, “Ccungccaw thong haw lae ning kha pote atu khuazi ka la thokuh sah lah, David kha ka la deehui sah. <verse number="2" style="v" />A thawbang lya te a lungthang lyakhe ka la phah cih zah ka la siisakuh cih; a kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn tuh a ccue cih hae. Siapharan kyalya kha ka la theih cih zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />ccungccaw balyn tuh a vawpaw inn lang a cceihpaw akaenung liaccanung hawte na kalan kae kikhae cih hae. Ccungccapaw lu kheit hiinnaw kyalya kha na ccungpaw thua zah ccungccaw balyn tuh daebabi lan a um cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e tuanaw pyapaw bya nynh Absalom te Israel piccan balyn kha mih lungrythuasah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hushai kya-e Tuanaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Absalom nynh, “Arkhi phin Hushai kha mah oun kotua oh, ho lan a hoipaw bya kha thaebua tua oh sih,” a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hushai tuh Absalom kalan he yn thua tuh, Absalom nynh amaw kha, “Ahithofel nynh hynhte a ho vae; aning nynh tuanaw oun pyapaw hawte ah cyih cih oh tou? Athua khyh ze, nang nynh oun hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Hushai nynh Absalom kha, “Ahithofel nynh tuanaw oun pyapaw hynh atu ccyh kya tuh hoy khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hushai nynh po ho zah, “Na paaw te a ccungccaw hae tuh athungpaw rhawkaw hae nynh athua hae cipaw te ramkaw kya a taw lawpyapaw vong hawte myaryamaw mih thinria cipaw kha phe na ny. Tuhpiaze, na paaw tuh rhawtuk myarya thyapaw thua zah, rhawkaw hae kya khuazi rya lan khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Atumaw heize laekarung sankhakheit kya khyhze ccangpaw hmin sankhakheit kya a rekuh vae cih. Masaty rhawtuknaw kya aening rhawkaw hae beihtaraw a chi hae ze, tuh-e bya a thaepaw miakaw nynh, ‘Absalom a zuipaw rhawkaw hae kha patae a chia vae hae,’ cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh chindeih thinlung alopaw thinlung a hoi hae paw mih rawthungpaw rhawkaw hae heize myarya a rih vae cih hae; pawccecize Israel hae balyn nynh na paaw tuh a thungpaw thua zah a kya um hae paw tuh mih rawthung cipaw kha a ny hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynhte tuanaw kae pya: Israel hae balyn tuh Dan kyate Beersheba kyacia, rili kin e laesia zeih alung hae paw zapi hae kha namaw kalan pum lan hae zah, rhawtuknaw kalan namaw ccaccei phe na cceihbua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning kha muih khonaw pawpaw hmin kya zemah ccianua lan zah, dangtui nynh laephi a ccawphu hawte ccawphu lan; amaw thuasah, a kya um hae paw thuasah lu kheit san hiin lan khyh hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua lungkhu lang yn tee ze, Israel hae balyn nynh khua lungkhu lang liarui ccyngkute khua kya-e lung taraw ccangkheit san a laehy lei lan ciate, tuh-e khua tuh accya langkhe sue lan,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Absalom te Israel ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Arkhi phin Hushai tuanaw tuh Ahithofel tuanaw laeze ahoyhua,” a ci hae. Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Absalom tungvaw ronaw a thuakhae nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ahithofel tuanaw ahoypaw kha ro khylan a paccyn vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hushai nynh David A Ccuesah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh Husai nynh ranpibawi Zadok te Abiathar kha, “Ahithofel nynh Absalom te Israel piccan hae kha hynhte khahte tuanaw a pya hae; kae nynh mah hynhte khahte tuanaw ka pya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze arangte ccungccaw saw oh lah, David kha, ‘Atu khuazi ramkaw e vaw zuanaw kya la um nan, pawpawte athua zemah vaw kha po la zua; tuhkhyhze tuh siapharan te a kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn tuh maemih na thua vae cih oh,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathan te Ahimaaz tuh Enrogel kya a ngaw hae; ryalahtunung lu kheit nynh leih cceih zah minmin kha a hopya hae, te minmin nynh leih cceih hae zah David Siapharan kha a hopya hae; pawccecize khua lungkhu lang a tee hae paw kha muihsakuh ry khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama imuapaw lu kheit nynh minmin kha muih hae zah Absalom kha a hopya; tukeiccuze parouh mawte arangte ccue hae zah, Bahurim khua e ccungccapaw inn kya a thua hae, tuh-e paw nynh a voidu lungkhu khe tuisung ccangkheit hoi zah, tuh-e lungkhu langkhe a rungbung hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccapaw zu nynh tuisung akhu kha ahu hu zah, a vawlan khe looh a rei; tuh-e kong tuh humhung nynh mah nyh khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Absalom a ryalahtu hae nynh inn kya umpaw nopinung kya he a thua hae te, “Ahimaaz te Jonathan teimou a um hae?” cite a khia hae. Nopinung nynh, “Khuraw lang phe zua vae hae,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh ccung hae zah a muih khyh hae keiccuze Jerusalem lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin a ki kou hae te, Ahimaaz te Jonathan tuh tuisung lungkhu te oun pou hae, te cceih hae zah David Siapharan kha a hopya hae. Minmin nynh David kha, “Thokuh lah, khuraw lang arangte zua; pawccecize Ahithofel nynh nang kha rawsete hynhte khahte tuanaw kha a pya vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te a kya um hae paw balyn tuh thokuh hae zah Jordan vaw a zua hae; khua yn dae tuh Jordan vaw a zua leipaw lu kheit san um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahithofel nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha zui khyh hae cipaw he a muih tuh, a lann kha khungnin de zah amaw khua lang a inn lang a cceih. Innbyn khuasahkunaw kha a hopah kou hae te, amaw toulou kha a nging saekuh zah a chih; te a paaw shawku kya a uu hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Absalom te Israel hae balyn nynh Jordan vaw he a zua kou hae tuh, David tuh Mahanaim khua a thua vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Absalom nynh Amasa kha Joab ccelang rhawkaw hae uktu lang a khang. Amasa tuh Ishmael ccungccaw a min Ithra cikuhpaw ccapaw nynh thua; Ithra nynh Abigail kha zu lang a umkhae, Abigail tuh Joab nung Zeruiah a neitawnung Nahash ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Absalom te Israel hae tuh Gilead ram kya ryahmin a tahku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David tuh Mahanaim khua he a thua te, Ammon hae ram e Rabbah khuapaw Nahash ccapaw Shobi, Lodebar khuapaw Ammiel ccapaw Makhir te Gilead ccungccaw Rogelim khuapaw Barzillai nynh <verse number="28" style="v" />ikhung hae, pakepi hae, laephi ang hae, chanvuih, barli, aepaw, thoupaw ccathae, pei hae, bia hae, <verse number="29" style="v" />khoitui, samateitui ahaawpaw, tuu, vaetua zaw kya-e mateitui haawsahpaw kha David te a kya um hae paw nynh a ae lan hae cite a ccyngpya hae; pawccecize minmin nynh, “Rhawkaw hae tuh ramkaw kya mih vuelaw zah thawbangte tui a haw hae,” a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Absalom Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh a kya umpaw ccungccaw hae kha pum hae zah, milu thong kheit uktu, za kheit uktu cite rhawbawi hae kha a khang hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh rhawkaw hae kha phu thum lang a phia hae: pum thum pum kheit kha Joab nynh a uk, pum thum pum kheit kha Zeruiah ccapaw Joab a neitaw Abishai nynh uk zah, pum thum pum kheit kha Git minphuinpaw Ittai nynh a uk. Siapharan nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Kamaw mah nae kya ka cceihbua cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hae nynh, “Na cceihbua lan khyh. Pawccecize kaening tuh kae ccue zemah pawlang oun ria lan khyh hae. Kaening angankuh kae chi zemah pawlang oun ria lan khyh hae. Thuasalama nang tuh kaening thong haw zeih na phupaw nynh thua; tukeiccuze khua kyate bawmnaw nae pya ze ahoyhua cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan nynh minmin kha, “Nanning nynh ahoyhua na ci oh paw kha ka cyih cih,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze siapharan tuh koikua pe khe thadyn zah rhawkaw hae tuh azaza athongthong te a cceih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Joab, Abishai te Ittai kha, “Kae ka liate ccangvaepaw Absalom kha nebaleih lante la ccuepe vae oh,” a cipya hae. Siapharan nynh Absalom te asekuh lante rhawbawi hae balyn kaw a pya hae paw kha ccungccaw balyn nynh a thaebua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite rhawkaw hae tuh Israel hae kha tuk khylan ramkaw lang cceih hae zah, Efraim tuhpi kyakhe rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae kha David ryalahtu hae nynh a tae hae, tuin nin kya ccungccaw patae chiakunaw um zah thong kuin a chih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw tuh ram pynpi kya a pazaekuh; tuin nin kya thaloi te a chihpaw laeze tuhpi kya a chihpaw alunghua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Absalom tuh David a ryalahtu hae ryte tualeipite a tungkuh hae. Absalom tuh a lann kha ccikuh zah, lann tuh aran myarya lungpaw phaesi ku kaw khe a cceih. Absalom lu tuh phaesi ku kya phang takeihkuh zah, vaaw te lae laku kya a saekuh, a ccikupaw lann tuh po a cceih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccapaw lu kheit nynh tuh-e tuh muih zah Joab kha, “Phaesi ku kya phang saekuhpaw Absalom kha ka muih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab nynh a hopahtupaw kha, “Pawte-e, Absalom na muih tou! Athua lanze, pawccemou tuin kya maw chiate laekhu lang na saw khyh? Ngunphua kia haw te taeccia kha he kae pya cih paw,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e paw nynh Joab kha, “Ka kuih kya ngunphua thong kheit yn pya hae ze heize, siapharan ccapaw kha ka kuih ka hangnua lan khyh; pawccecize kae thaebuanaw kya khaw siapharan nynh namaw, Abishai te Ittai kha, ‘Kae ka liate ccangvaepaw Absalom kha thungkhaw oh!’ cite kaw ae pya oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhlae lanze, lungzinaw hoi leite aning kha ka la chia ze (siapharan kya tuh pawpaw mah phei kho um khyh zah), nang hynh mah nae pankhae tali lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Joab nynh, “Nang te hynhcite accyh ka thangsah han vae lan khyh,” a cipya. A kuih kya ccoi ccangthum ccyngkuh zah, phaesi ku kya phang a hiin ungpaw Absalom bung kha a thuing. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Joab kya-e rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu hae lu haw nynh Absalom kha koihlute thuing hae zah a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh Joab nynh mungkae tu zah rhawkaw hae kha a khee hae keiccuze Israel hae a deehuitu rhawkaw hae tuh oun ki hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom kha lah hae zah tuhpi kya-e hunghuapi kalan vua hae zah, myarya lepaw lungpum a pumthin hae. Israel hae balyn tuh mih inn lang a ccue vae hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Absalom nynh a hiin lyakhe, “Ka min liathuinaw lanpaw ccapaw ka hoi khyh,” ci zah, Siapharan Accya kyakhe lungbing ccangkheit bingkuh zah amaw min kha a phu. Tuh-e tuh atunin cia Absalom Lungbing a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Absalom A Chipaw A Thae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Zadok ccapaw Ahimaaz nynh, “Ka la ccue sah lah, siapharan kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na rhaw hae thungnaw kyate ae luesah vae, cite the ka la thaesah cih,” a ci. <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab nynh amaw kha, “Nang nynh atunin the na thaesah lan khyh; nyalang nin kya na thaesah cih; atunin tuh siapharan ccapaw a chi keiccuze na thaesah lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Joab nynh Kush minphuinpaw lu kheit kha, “La cceih lah, na muihpaw kha siapharan la hopah,” a cipya. Kush minphuinpaw tuh Joab malang bakhung zah a ccue. <verse number="22" style="v" />Zadok ccapaw Ahimaaz nynh Joab kha, “Pawpawte athua zemah, Kush minphuinpaw nulang te kae mah ka la ccue sah,” bua a cipya. Joab nynh, “Ka ccapaw, pawccemou na ccue cih? Tuh-e the na thaesah liate lasung na mue lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahimaaz nynh, “Pawpawte thua zemah, ka ccue cih,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Joab nynh, “Ccue,” a cipya. Ahimaaz tuh Bialae laanpi te ccue zah, Kush minphuinpaw kha po a thoih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David tuh koikua thyh ning laku kya a haung. Rhawviapaw nynh khualungrua kyate koikua adawkuhpaw innccuvaw lang po kae zah, ngaw he a do tuh a makhaete yn ccue cciamangpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit kha a muih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Rhawviapaw nynh sia zah siapharan kha a hopya. Siapharan nynh, “A makhaepaw athua zetuh, thongpang yn phupaw nynh athua cih,” a ci. Aning tuh po yn cceih zah yn naekuh vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te rhawviapaw nynh yn ccue cciamangpaw ccangpaw lu kheit kha a muih; rhawviapaw nynh koikua a ngawpaw kha ko zah, “Dotua, mingccangpaw a makhaete yn ccue cciamang!” a cipya. Siapharan nynh, “Aning mah thongpang yn thuakhae cih,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Rhawviapaw nynh, “Masaty e paw nynh a ccuepaw tuh Zadok ccapaw Ahimaaz nynh a ccuepaw te nynh aloku,” a ci. Siapharan nynh, “Aning tuh ccungccaw hoypaw thua zah, thehoypaw yn thuakhae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Ahimaaz nynh siapharan kha ko zah, “Marya ahoy!” a cipya. Siapharan malang laekhu khe bakhung zah, “Siapharan ka bawipaw ae doutu hae paw kha ae pyatupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Ccangvaepaw Absalom kha a dan tou?” a ci. Ahimaaz nynh, “Joab nynh na ryalahtupaw yn saw lya tuh ngaluin-ngaluin ccae hae paw kha ka muih zah, pawte nynh athua cipaw ka nyh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Nuekuh lah, hein kya thadyntua hin,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze aning nynh nuekuh zah, phang a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Te Kush minphuinpaw tuh yn thua zah Kush paw nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw hanlan thehoypaw a um! Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang ae doutu hae balyn thungnaw kyate nang kha ae luesah zah, atunin phu ae lawpya vae,” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Kush minphuinpaw kha, “Ccangvaepaw Absalom kha a dan tou?” cite a khia. Kush minphuinpaw nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw rhaw hae te nang kha vawsawnaw pya lan ae thonuakuh hae paw balyn tuh tuh-e ccangvaepaw hawte thua vae hae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Absalom elang David A Rah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Siapharan tuh myarya a ngaethah zah, koikua vawlan umpaw akhaan kalan kae zah a rah; a cceih lalia lante, “Pou ka ccapaw Absalom, ka ccapaw, ka ccapaw Absalom! Nang na hanpaw kha kamaw ka la chih ravo nyn, pou Absalom, ka ccapaw, ka ccapaw!” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Siapharan tuh palei rah zah Absalom elang ngaethya rawkhuite a um,” cite Joab kha a hopya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuin nin e taenaw tuh rhawkaw hae balyn hanlan rawkhui nawlan a tang; pawccecize rhawkaw hae nynh tuin nin khe, “Siapharan tuh a ccapaw elang myarya a ngaethah,” cite a thae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw kyate a ccuepaw rhawkaw hae nynh mih maethah zah aruh lante a ccue hae hawte, tuin nin khe rhawkaw hae tuh khua lungkhu lang aruh lante a tee hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan tuh a mae kha bongkuh zah, “Pou ka ccapaw Absalom, pou Absalom, ka ccapaw, ka ccapaw!” cite siapharan tuh roi myarya ccae lante a rah. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Joab nynh siapharan kalan inn lungkhu lang tee zah, “Na hiinnaw, na ccapaw hae te na ccanung hae hiinnaw, na zu hae te na lovae hae hiinnaw a khumtu hae na kuihkaw e bawi hae mae miakaw kha maethyanaw te atunin na bong vae hae, <verse number="6" style="v" />pawccecize nang ae hua hae paw kha na sungsah hae zah, ae sungsah hae paw kha na hua hae. Na rhawbawi hae te na kuihkaw e bawi hae tuh pawpaw mah thua khyh hae cipaw kha atunin ccaerarih lan na langsaku vae; pawccecize atunin kya Absalom tuh la hiin sah lah, kaening balyn tuh kae la chi lanze, nang tuh na lungrythua cih, cipaw ka muih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu palou toikuh lah, na ryalahtu hae kha nebaleih lante hopah hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate bya ka kinku, na ccia khyh lanze, atu khuazi lu kheit sanmah na kya um vae lan khyh hae; tuh-e tuh na di lyate atu cia na tungvaw accah boi paw ronaw balyn laeze athah huapaw athua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan tuh thokuh zah koikua kya a haung. “Dotua oh, siapharan tuh koikua kya a haung,” cite rhawkaw hae kha a hopya hae; te rhawkaw hae balyn tuh amaw malang oun thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David kha Jerusalem lang A Ko hae</para>
  <para style="p">Tuh ccyh lyakhe Israel hae balyn tuh mih inn raveih lang a ccue vae hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel phin hae balyn kyakhe ccungccaw balyn tuh bya eikuh hae zah, “Siapharan nynh ah rhaw hae kuih kyate oun luesah zah, Filistin hae kuih kyate oun khum; atu tuh Absalom keiccuze ram kyate a ccue vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama oun uktu lang chitui ah thuh oh paw Absalom tuh rhawtuknaw kya a chih vae. Tukeiccuze atu pawccemou siapharan kikhae lanpaw kong kha pawpaw san na ho khyh oh?” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David Siapharan nynh ranpibawi hae Zadok te Abiathar kalan ccungccaw saw zah, “Judah piccan hae kyakhe, ‘Siapharan kha a inn lang kikhae khylan nanning tuh pawccemou nya na thya oh? Israel hae balyn nynh a ho hae paw bya kha siapharan kalan phe thua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning tuh ka puizia, ka ru te ka saw nynh na thua oh; athua lanze, siapharan kha kikhae khylan pawccemou nya na thya oh?’ cite la hopah oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Amasa kha, ‘Nang tuh ka ru te ka saw na thua khyh tou? Nang tuh Joab ccelang ka rhawkaw hae bawipaw lang na tang khyh lanze, Pachia nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e ciate thuasah, tuhlaeze alung lante mah cyih vae sah,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh Judah hae thinlung kha ccungccaw lu kheit thinlung hawte a law kho keiccuze minmin nynh siapharan kha byataw hae zah, “Nang tuh na ryalahtu hae balyn ryte oun ki oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan tuh Jordan lang a ki; Judah hae tuh siapharan kha cciadue khylan te Jordan vaw zuakhae khylan Gilgal lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin phinpaw, Gera ccapaw Shimei tuh Judah hae ryte David Siapharan kha cciadue khylan Bahurim khua kyate arangte a cceih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">2Sa 16.5-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />amaw kyakhe Benjamin phin hae thong kheit a um hae. Te Saul innbyn kya ryalahtu Ziba tuh a ccapaw hae lu haw lae pangaw te a ryalahtu hae lu kuin ryte siapharan malang khe Jordan vaw kalan a ccuebung hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />siapharan innbyn kha zuakhae khylan te siapharan a ry hawte cyipya khylan vaw kha a zua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Shimei Thaw A Cci</para>
  <para style="p">Te siapharan nynh Jordan vaw a zua dyn khe Gera ccapaw Shimei nynh a malang bakhung zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />siapharan kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw nynh Jerusalem lang na pou nin kya na ryalahtupaw nynh ka cyiseinaw kha ka bawipaw nynh yn ccuinpah nan lah, yn liathuipah nan; siapharan nynh na lung kya beih nung nan. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize ka sei vae cipaw kha na ryalahtupaw nynh ka nyku vae; tukeiccuze, dotua, atunin siapharan ka bawipaw kha cciadue khylan Josef ciihan hae balyn kyaze masaty kae thua vae,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Abishai nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui a thuhpaw kha thya a law keiccuze Shimei hynh chia lan ccan khyh tou?” cite a khung. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh, “Nanning Zeruiah ccapaw hae, atunin ka rhaw hae lang tang lan ciate kae te nanning tuh pawmou asekuh? Atunin Israel ccungccaw lukhakheit kha chia lan accan zawtou? Pawccecize atunin Israel hae kya siapharan ka thuapaw hynh ka nyhkuh khyh tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Shimei kha, “Na chih lan khyh,” a cipya. Te siapharan nynh bya a kinpyaku.</para>
  <para style="s1">David te Mefibosheth Tungkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul mintawpaw Mefibosheth tuh siapharan kha cciadue khylan yn cceihbung; siapharan a pou nin kyate khyndadyh lan a ki nin kyacia, a ccu mah ccikankuh khyh, a khawming mah ngokuh khyh, a boeining mah sukuh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1-13">2Sa 9.1-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan cciadue khylan Jerusalem kyate he a cceih te, siapharan nynh Mefibosheth kha, “Mefibosheth, pawccemou ka kya na cciabua khyh?” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Pou siapharan, ka bawipaw, ka ryalahtupaw nynh phe yn ling; pawccecize na ryalahtupaw kae nynh amaw kha, ‘Ka hanlan lann kha khungnin yn depah, ka ccikuh cih zah siapharan kya ka cceihbua cih,’ ka cipya. Pawccecize na ryalahtupaw tuh ka ccukhou. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh siapharan ka bawipaw kha ka konglang ae hynpya. Thuasalama siapharan ka bawipaw tuh Pachia vaawpaw te nynh na loku oh; tukeiccuze ahoy na ci hawte cyitua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawccecize ka paaw innbyn hae balyn tuh siapharan ka bawipaw malang chi lan accan hae paw nynh thua hae; thuasalama na ccaboi kya a ae hae paw laku kya na ryalahtupaw hynh nae nungbua. Tukeiccuze siapharan kalan ccangpaw ngianaw kaw ka hoi ung cih zawtou?” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan nynh amaw kha, “Na konglang tuh pawccemou na ho ung? Nang te Ziba nynh ram kha na neekuh cih oh, cite bya phe ka pae vae,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mefibosheth nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw tuh inn lang khyndadyh lan nae thua nyngkae tuh, aning nynh marya lawkuh sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Barzillai Ngaethyaumsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead ccungccaw Barzillai tuh Rogelim khua kyate yn cceihbung zah, siapharan kha Jordan khuraw lang cia saw khylan siapharan ryte a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2Sa 17.27-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzillai tuh kum sung tarya cih vae zah myarya a taw vae. Siapharan tuh Mahanaim khua a um lyakhe aning nynh looh a pya; pawccecize aning tuh myarya a hoipaw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Barzillai kha, “Ka kalan cceihbua lah, Jerusalem khua kya kae do-oih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama Barzillai nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan ryte Jerusalem lang ka cciabua thung lanpaw tuh kae hynh kum hohzeihmou ka hiin ung cih? <verse number="35" style="v" />Atu hynh kum sung tarya ka cih vae; ahoypaw te athahpaw kha ka phiathya ung cih tou? Na ryalahtupaw nynh ka aepaw te ka niapaw hynh a thua thua khyh cipaw ka nyh kho ung cih zawtou? Hlawsahpaw pise hae te hlawsahpaw nopi hae roi kha ka ngae kho ung cih zawtou? Tukeiccuze na ryalahtupaw hynh siapharan ka bawipaw hanlan pawccemou phupaw ari chihpaw lang ka tang lanpaw tuh? <verse number="36" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw nynh Jordan vaw khuraw lang syngtaraw cia siapharan kya ka cceihbua cih. Siapharan nynh tuhcihawpaw lasung tuh pawccemou yn pya cih? <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka khua kya, ka nung ka paaw hae shawku pe khe ka chi nawlan, na ryalahtupaw hynh thawccinawte beih yn kisah. Thuasalama hein kya na ryalahtu Khimham a um; aning hynh siapharan ka bawipaw kya cceihbua sah; ahoy na ci hawte amaw kha la cyipah,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Khimham tuh ka kya a cceihbua cih, te nang nynh ahoy na ci hawte ka cyipah cih; nae ngiapaw miakaw kha kae cyipah cih,” cite a khung. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te ccungccaw balyn tuh Jordan vaw kha zua hae zah siapharan mah a zua; siapharan nynh Barzillai kha myng zah hythua a pya, te Barzillai tuh a inn lang a ki. <verse number="40" style="v" />Siapharan tuh Gigal lang po cceih zah Khimham tuh a kya a cceihbua; Judah hae balyn te Israel hae angankuh nynh siapharan kha a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Te Israel hae balyn tuh siapharan kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Pawccemou kae uno Judah hae nynh nang kha ae ruh hae zah, siapharan ryte na innbyn hae te David ccungccaw hae kha Jordan vaw khuraw lang ae cciakhae oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Judah hae balyn nynh Israel hae kha, “Siapharan tuh kae naekuhpaw kae puizia athua keiccu nynh thua. E kong kyahin pawccemou nae thinria? Kaening nynh siapharan looh kha kae ae zawtou? Tuhkhyhze aning nynh lasung ccangkhakheit oun pya zawtou?” cite a khung hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh Judah hae kha, “Kaening nynh siapharan tungvaw kya ccoupaw ccanghaw kae hoi, te David tungvaw kya mah nanning laeze alunghua kae hoi. Pawccemou nae theihrya oh? Kae siapharan kikhae lanpaw kong kha kaening nynh masaty kae ho khyh tou?” cite a khung hae. Thuasalama Judah hae bya tuh Israel hae bya laeze arehua.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sheba nynh Dounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Benjamin phinpaw Bikhri ccapaw Sheba cikuhpaw acouseikuhpaw lu kheit a um. Aning nynh mungkae tu zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pou Israel hae, kaening tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">David kya ccoupaw kae hoi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jesse ccapaw kya rho kae hoi khyh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw miakaw nae bu</para>
  <para style="q1">raveih lang cceih oh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a sia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:16">1Si 12.16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 10:16">2Sh 10.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae balyn nynh David kyate pou hae zah Bikhri ccapaw Sheba kha a zui hae; thuasalama Judah hae nynh tuh Jordan vaw kyate Jerusalem cia mih siapharan kha tynkaring lan a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David tuh Jerusalem khua e a inn kya a thua; siapharan nynh inn do-oih khylan a cciataw hae paw a lovae hae lu haw kha a ko hae, te rhawviatu a umpaw inn kyakhe nung hae zah a kua hae, thuasalama minmin kha ikhae khyh hae. Tukeiccuze minmin kha mih chi makhia tuin kyakhe khung hae zah nomae hawte a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:22">2Sa 16.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Amasa kha, “Nin thum lungkhu Judah hae kha ka kalan oun ko hae lah, namaw mah umbua,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Amasa tuh Judah hae ko lan a cceih; thuasalama aning tuh accyh khyapyapaw laeze arohua. <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh Abishai kha, “Absalom laeze Bikhri ccapaw Sheba nynh aening tungvaw vawsawnaw oun pyahua cih; na bawipaw ryalahtu hae kha hoeikute Sheba kha deehui oh, tuhkhyhze tuh aning nynh akoihkuhpaw khua hae lungkhu lang a tee cih zah, aening kyate a luesei cih,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abishai kha Joab ccungccaw hae, Khereth hae, Peleth hae te rhawkaw hae balyn nynh a zui hae; Bikhri ccapaw Sheba kha deehui khylan Jerusalem kyate a thokuh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon kya umpaw lungtungpi myarya lepaw kya he a thua hae tuh, Amasa tuh minmin te tungku khylan yn cceih. Joab tuh rhawkaw boeining kha lawkuh zah tuh-e vawlan khe thaloi kha abu ryte a tae kyakhe taeccia te a cciabiaku; malang a ccia lyakhe tuh-e tuh phe accah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab nynh Amasa kha, “Ka neitaw, na dan tou?” a cipya. Joab nynh Amasa kha myng khylan a ranglang kuih te a khawming kha a kyng. <verse number="10" style="v" />Amasa nynh Joab kuih kya umpaw thaloi kha nyh khyh; tukeiccuze Joab nynh a vue kha thuing zah a ring tuh laekhu lang ccah zah a chih. Aning nynh vae ningnaw thuing chih vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">Te Joab te a neitaw Abishai nynh Bikhri ccapaw Sheba kha a deehui hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab ccungccapaw lu kheit tuh Amasa pe khe thadyn zah, “Joab kalan a panpaw miakaw te David kalan a panpaw miakaw nynh Joab kha zui oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Amasa tuh laanluepi kya a chii kyakhe a huekuh. Laanluepi kya a cceih hae paw balyn nynh amaw kha muih hae zah a thadyn hae; ccungccaw hae balyn nynh a thadyn hae paw kha Joab ccungccapaw nynh a muih keiccuze Amasa kha laanluepi kyate ramkaw lang nue zah boei a bong. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhcite laanluepi kyate a nue koute tuh, Bikhri ccapaw Sheba kha deehui khylan ccungccaw balyn nynh Joab kha a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sheba tuh Beth-maakah ram, Abel khua kyacia Israel phin hae balyn kalan po lekuh lan a cceih; Bikhri ccungccaw hae balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah Joab kha a zui hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Joab rhawkaw hae nynh oun cceih hae zah Beth-maakah ram, Abel khua umpaw Sheba kha a koih hae; minmin nynh khua kha marung thaenuakuh hae zah rhawlungrua kha a rawse hae. Joab rhawkaw hae nynh khualungrua kha ting khylan lae kha a thae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te ahawpaw nopinung nynh khua lungkhu te, “Ngaetua oh! Ngaetua oh! Joab kha, ‘Hynhlang yn cceih, bya hopya kae ry,’ a ci cite hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Joab tuh a kalan naekuh zah, nopinung nynh, “Joab na thua tou?” cite khia zah, aning nynh, “Ka thua,” cite a khung. Te nopinung nynh Joab kha, “Na ryalahtunung bya hynh yn ngaepya tua,” a cipya. Joab nynh, “Phang ka ngae,” cite a khung. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh, “Langmawlya tuh, ‘Abel khua kya tuanaw ngiakuh hae sah,’ cite leih a ho hae; tuhcite byathan kha leih a ccawsaku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Kae tuh Israel ram kyaze daenaw a rypaw te a lungzipaw lu kheit nynh ka thua; nang nynh Israel ram kyaze nung athuapaw khua kha ro lan na ccung; pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rho kha na roh cih?” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab nynh, “Tuh-e tuh kae te sawkuh vae sah, khua kha ka laang lan khyh, ro mah ka roh lan khyh! <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhcite tuh thua khyh! Efraim muaram e ccungccapaw lu kheit a min Sheba cikuhpaw Bikhri ccapaw nynh David Siapharan kha rawsete a kuih a hangnua; amaw makhae kha yn pya lah, khua kyate ka pou cih,” cite a khung. Nopinung nynh Joab kha, “Tuh-e paw a lu kha khualungrua kyate na kalan kae vuapah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh ahawpaw paccynnaw te ccungccaw balyn kalan a cceih. Bikhri ccapaw Sheba lu kha pae hae zah, Joab kalan khe a vuapya hae. Joab nynh mungkae tu zah khua kyate a pou hae, mih balynte mih inn raveih lang a cceih hae, Joab tuh siapharan kalan Jerusalem lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab tuh Israel rhawkaw balyn a uktu rhawbawi nynh thua; Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh Khereth hae te Peleth hae kha a uk hae; <verse number="24" style="v" />Adoram tuh nangsete ryalawsahnaw kya a uktu nynh thua; Ahilud ccapaw Jehoshafat tuh ccazing kyngtu nynh thua; <verse number="25" style="v" />Sheva tuh ryaccinkhan nynh thua; Zadok te Abiathar tuh ranpibawi hae nynh thua hae; <verse number="26" style="v" />Jair ccungccaw Ira hynh mah David ranpibawi nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Gibeon hae Phulawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David ccyh lyakhe kum thum lungkhu, kum kheit koute kum kheit ccakanccih zah, David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a khia. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Saul te a innbyn tungvaw kya chiise luasahpaw seinaw a um, pawccecize aning nynh Gibeon hae kha a chia hae,” a ci. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh Gibeon hae kha ko hae zah a hopya hae. (Gibeon hae tuh Israel hae thua khyh hae, Amor hae a laehy hae paw nynh thua hae; Israel hae nynh minmin kha kae haang cih oh cite bya a la kinpyaku hae zemah, Saul nynh Israel hae te Judah hae kha myarya pankhae hae zah minmin kha maemih lan a zuaku.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3-15">Jos 9.3-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh Gibeon hae kha, “Pawmou kae cyipah cih oh? Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rho kha hythua na pya nawlan oh, pawtemou seithyaanaw kae rae cih?” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon hae nynh amaw kha, “Kaening te Saul te a innbyn laku e byathan hynh sui te ngun kong thua khyh; Israel ccungccaw lu kheit sanmah kae theih lan khyh,” a cipya hae. Aning nynh, “Nae hanlan pawmou cyipyaku na ry oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh siapharan kha, “Kaening nynh Israel ram pynpi kya umnaw hmin kae hoi khyh nawlan, kaening hynh oun maemih zah ro lan a paccyntupaw <verse number="6" style="v" />a ccapaw hae kya-e lu sari kha kae kuih kalan oun pya lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua vawlan Gibeon khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe minmin kha kae sae cih hae,” a cipya hae. Siapharan nynh, “Minmin kha kae pya cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan nynh Saul ccapaw Jonathan a ccapaw Mefibosheth kha tuh a haang, pawccecize David te Saul ccapaw Jonathan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe byakinkunaw a la rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:15-17">1Sa 20.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 9:1-7">2Sa 9.1-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Aiah ccanung Rizpah te Saul nynh a saah hae paw ccapaw lu ning Armoni te Mefibosheth kha thuasah, Saul ccanung Merab te Meholah khuapaw Barzillai ccapaw Adriel nynh a saah hae paw ccapaw lu pangaw kha thuasah siapharan nynh a ko hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:19">1Sa 18.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />David nynh minmin kha Gibeon hae kuih kalan a pya hae, Gibeon hae nynh minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang mua vawlan khe thuing hae zah, lu sari mawte a chihkheih hae. Minmin tuh barli loohrue takaw lyakhe a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh Aiah ccanung Rizpah nynh loohrue takaw ccyh kyate vaawlang te khuaa a raw makhia buriboei kha lah zah lung vawlan khe a phaeku; khuadae ccyh kyaze mih rhua vawlan khe azouthyapaw pavaw hae kha ccusah khyh hae, khuazi ccyh kya mah sarepaw hae kyate a thungkhaw hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aiah ccanung Rizpah, Saul a lovaenung nynh tuhte a cyipaw kha David kya he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />David nynh cceih zah Filistin hae nynh Saul kha Gilboa mua kya a chia nin hae ze, Filistin hae nynh a saenaw hae Bethshan khua e zapi tungkunaw laanpi kya-e mih rhua a ruhtu hae Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae kyakhate Saul ru te a ccapaw Jonathan ru kha a law.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:8-13">1Sa 31.8-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Aning nynh tuin kya umpaw Saul ru te a ccapaw Jonathan ru kha a cciakhae; a thuing hae paw ccungccaw hae mih ru kha a pum hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul ru te a ccapaw Jonathan ru kha Benjamin ram Zela khua umpaw a paaw Kish shawku kyakhe a uu hae; siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae paw miakaw kha a cyi hae. Tuh-e koute ram hanlan a ngia hae paw kha Pachia nynh a ccoupya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Ccungccaw hae tungvaw Amia Ccungkunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1Sh 20.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha bua tuk hae zah, David te a ryalahtu hae tuh a cceihbung hae. Filistin hae kha tuk hae zah, David tuh myarya a thawbang. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw lepaw hae mintaw lu kheit athuapaw Ishbi-benob nynh sohin shekel za thum aripaw ccoi te zunghe thawpaw kha ccyngkuh zah, David kha ka theih cih, a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama Zeruiah ccapaw Abishai nynh amaw kha bawm khylan yn thuanua zah, Filistin paw kha tuk zah a chia. Tetuh David kha a ccungccaw hae nynh, “Israel maeekhua kha na thesei khyh nawlan, rhawtuknaw lang kae kya na cceihbua vae lan khyh,” cite byakinkute a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1Si 11.36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:17">Sam 132.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />E koute Gob kyakhe Filistin hae ryte rhawtukkunaw bua a um; Hushath ccungccaw Sibbekai nynh ccungccaw lepaw hae mintaw lu kheit athuapaw Saf kha a chia. <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Gob kyakhe Filistin hae ryte ccangpaw rhawtukkunaw bua a um; Bethlehem khuapaw Jaare-oregim ccapaw Elhanan nynh boeikuanawpaw phaeccya cia acihpaw ccoi alua a kyngpaw Git ccungccaw Goliath kha a chia. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Gath kyakhe rhawtukkunaw bua a um, tuin kyakhe a pyn myarya lepaw ccungccapaw lu kheit, a kuihdung ccangtaruh cci, a ccudung ccangtaruh cci, abalynte ccangkuin lae pali asaepaw a um; aning mah ccungccaw lepaw hae ciihan nynh athuabua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh Israel hae kha he a theihrya hae tuh, David a upaw Shimei ccapaw Jonathan nynh amaw kha a chia. <verse number="22" style="v" />E lu pali hae tuh Gath khua kya um hae paw ccungccaw lepaw hae ciihan nynh athua hae; David te a ryalahtu hae kuih te a chih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David A Lungtuanaw Hlaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18:1-50">Sam 18.1-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a rhaw hae balyn kuih kyate thuasah, Saul kuih kyate thuasah a luesah nin khe, aning nynh e hlaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a sah. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ka lungpi,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rhawlungrua te yn luesahtu,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pachia, ka khynnaw lungpi,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khynnawpaw ka khawriaphua te</para>
  <para style="q1">yn khumpaw saki,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rhawhohung te ka khynnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khumtu nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rawsetu hae kyate nae khum.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thehoysah lan angaekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka ko zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rhaw hae kyate khum ka thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize chinaw tuileih nynh yn koihlu,</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw tuithaw nynh yn luathin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chinaw arui nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phang yn khethinku;</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw kaang nynh phang yn kaesah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka vawsaw lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka ko;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia kha ka ko.</para>
  <para style="q1">A beikinn kyate ka roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thaepah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sianaw tuh a nakaring kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pachia a thinria keiccuze laephi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hy zah a thyngkuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui leihpaw hae mah</para>
  <para style="q2">thyngkuh hae zah a hy hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A naduh kyate maekhuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pouthung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khalang kyate aruapaw maeesoi te</para>
  <para style="q2">zaezae epaw maeehue apou.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaawlui kha nesah bung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rungbung;</para>
  <para style="q1">marae zipingpaw mohnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccu kaw kya a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherubim kha ccikuh zah a zou;</para>
  <para style="q2">khivae sake vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha a muih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mohnaw athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking thaawkalaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">tui apumkuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a pepan po voilu lan</para>
  <para style="q2">bongnawpaw lang a rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A malang e phaephae akpaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">maeehue tuh zaezae a e.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mah vaawlui khe</para>
  <para style="q2">kholung lang thyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a roi a saw.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te a the kha kaw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae kha a phiasaku hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ria he a kawsah tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae a ccue vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pe hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a naduh kyate hy he a saw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">rilipi kaw phe lang zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi aleihpaw mah phe alang.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahangnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn dyngnuakuh zah yn hoeilang;</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya khupaw tui lungkhu kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">po yn sue.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Athungpaw ka rhaw hae kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae yn hua hae paw kyate thuasah yn luesah;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw a thung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh ka vawsaw ccyh</para>
  <para style="q2">lyakhe yn thuanua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn bawmtu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akopaw hmin kalan yn cciakhae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka tungvaw a lungrythua keiccuze yn luesah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka dingnaw thyhte lasung yn pya;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih a thyaa thyhte yn pyaru.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka zui zah, seinaw raete</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia kyate ka phiakuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize a phungzae hae</para>
  <para style="q2">balyn kha ka zui zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a phungbya hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka vua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A malang ccaenaw um leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua zah, hoyleinaw kha ka sibia.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka dingnaw thyhte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a muihnaw kya ka thyaa thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasah yn pyaru vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lungzipaw tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">lungzinaw kha na langsaku,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaenaw a um leipaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccae lan um leinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na langsaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Athyaapaw ccungccaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaanaw kha na langsaku;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hoyleipaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsenaw kha na langsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zakaw a sangsakuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw kha na khum,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama lysakunaw</para>
  <para style="q2">mitdae a dae hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na biabung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka maeekhua nynh na thua ccaccing;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka mohnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a awsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Namaw liate ka rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ro kho hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka Pachia liate khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">po ka zou kho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />E Pachia tuh a laanpi phe accing;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakinpyakunaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ahmepaw kha ccaekia akhan;</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning tuh amaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a rekuh hae paw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khawriaphua nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laelan</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou Pachia athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">aening Pachia laelan</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou lungpi athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pachia nynh thawzung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tae kya yn khiidepah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka laanpi kha ako lante</para>
  <para style="q2">yn hungpya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka ccu kha sazuh ccu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a liazawsah zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 3:19">Hab 3.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">ahangnaw khe khyndadyh lan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn nung.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka kuihbaw nynh sohin li kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a sue kho nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kuih kha rhawtuk nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ccangpya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na khumnaw khawriaphua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae pya vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae bawmnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn lesaesah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ccianaw laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kosahpah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccu tuh thei khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka deehui hae zah ka ro hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka maemih makhia hae</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kitaw khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin kha ka maemih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a thokuh kho lei lan hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccu kaw kya a khuliakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawccecize rhawtuknaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung kha ka tae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">nae khiidepya;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rhaw hae kha ka zakaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">na bakhungsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka rhaw hae kha ka kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">na maeleihsakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae yn hua hae paw kha ka ro hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A do hae zemah minmin</para>
  <para style="q2">a khum lan hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung mah um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a sia hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">khungru khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Vuiping hawte phe khui lan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka miade hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi kya-e tuiccua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka syde hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae ryte rhawkunaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kyate nae luesah;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae lu lang nae nung;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ny boi leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">rya oun lawpya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ramccang hae tuh bohkute</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kalan oun cceih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya he a thae takaw hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kaw a ngae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ramccang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawthah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih rhawlungrua lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">thyngkute oun pou hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin!</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka lungpi tuh thehoyte um sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Yn khumtu lungpi athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia tuh hangthungte um sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Pachia tuh phulawrunaw</para>
  <para style="q2">yn pyatu thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha ka zakaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a sangsahtu hae nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ka rhaw hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">poh yn thuaatu nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">yn rawsetu hae luki lang</para>
  <para style="q2">nae hangthung;</para>
  <para style="q1">a puathopaw ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">kyate nae luesah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thehoysah cih zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:9">Rom 15.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">na min thehoysahnaw hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw a khangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan kha taenaw lepaw a pya;</para>
  <para style="q1">chitui a thuhpaw David te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ciihan hae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">atynpaw sungsahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae a langsahpya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Nyathya Hopaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hynh David nynh nyathyakou a hopaw bya nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">Jesse ccapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh a hangthungpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob Pachia nynh chitui a thuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae elang hlaw hoypaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a phuapaw David bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha mangte bya a ho,</para>
  <para style="q2">a bya tuh ka lae kya a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel Pachia nynh a ho vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel lungpi nynh yn hopya vae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw hae kha dingnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">uk hae zah, Pachia rawrite a uktupaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />awkhua e awnaw hawte thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking athyaapaw awkhua ccyh</para>
  <para style="q1">kya yn thuathungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin te nynh aloku,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaa a rah koute laephi vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua a thosahpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">awnaw te nynh aloku.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka innbyn tuh Pachia malang</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hawte thadyn khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize kamaw ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw byakinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a rae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn-are kha ccingsah zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a khynsah vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kamaw bawmnaw balyn te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rynaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccingsah leite tou a um cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia pawlangria</para>
  <para style="q2">lei hae paw tuh vuapaw hinpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hawte nynh athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize minmin kha kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">law kho thua khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khah-e hae kha kyng nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw ccong khyhze</para>
  <para style="q1">ccoi kha mang aho.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khah-e hae kha maee te</para>
  <para style="q1">khaleih soi athua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Athungpaw David Rhawkaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1Sh 11.10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />E hae tuh David nynh a hoipaw athungpaw rhawkaw hae nynh thua hae: Takhemon ccungccapaw Josheb-Basshebeth tuh lu thum hae kyaze lupi nynh thua; aning nynh a ccoi ccyngkute ccungccaw za tarya kha ccyh kheit kya a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e paw koute he a zuipaw tuh Ahohi ccapaw Dodo a ccapaw Eleazar nynh thua. Rhawtuk khylan a sueluakuh hae paw Filistin hae kha minmin nynh a dou lya hae ze, aning tuh David ryte a umkheih hae. Israel hae nynh nulang a ki lya hae ze, <verse number="10" style="v" />aning tuh a umnaw hmin kya phang a thadyn. A kuih tuh bang zah thaloi kya phe a ngeikuh lan cia, Filistin hae kha a chia hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuin nin khe taenaw lepaw kha a rae. Israel hae tuh a chih hae paw kya-e uccaw kha khahku khylan kyalya nynh Eleazar kalan a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaw koute he a zuipaw tuh Harar ccungccapaw Agi ccapaw Shammah nynh thua. Filistin hae tuh Lehi kya a sueluakuh hae, Lehi kyakhe bia ku phe abeihpaw loo a um. Israel rhawkaw hae tuh Filistin hae kyate a ccue hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh loo ngaelung khe thadynnaw hmin lawkuh zah, tuh-e hmin kha thungkhawte Filistin hae kha a chia hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh taenaw lepaw kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Loohrue ccyh azaw takaw lyakhe mih cciakhaetu hae sung thum kya-e lu thum tuh Adullam lungkarung kya umpaw David kalan a cceih hae, tuh ccyh lyakhe Filistin hae phu kheit tuh Refaim accya kya a rya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />David tuh rhawlungrua lungkhu um zah, Filistin rhawviatu rhawkaw hae tuh Bethlehem khua kya a um hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />David nynh a lawleih zah, “Lukhakheit nynh koikua pe umpaw Bethlehem tuisung kya-e tui kha ka nia lan yn pya ravo nyn!” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh athungpaw rhawkaw lu thum hae nynh Filistin hae ryahmin kha roh hae zah koikua pe umpaw Bethlehem tuisung kya-e tui kha the hae zah David kalan a cciakhae hae. Thuasalama David nynh nia leite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe moh lae zah, <verse number="17" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e tui hynh nia leite ka um sah. Ka chi ze ka chih cite a cceih hae paw chiise kha ka neih kho cih zawtou?” a ci. Tukeiccuze aning nynh neih khyh. Tuh-e rhawkaw hae lu thum nynh tuhcite rya a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joab neitaw Zeruiah a ccapaw Abishai tuh Ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kyaze lupi nynh thua. A ccoi te ccungccaw za thum kha tuk hae zah a chia hae keiccuze Lu Thum hae kya a minthaanbua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning tuh Ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kyaze a minthaan huaccepaw thua zah mih rhawbawipaw lang a tang; thuasalama Lu Thum hae hawte tuh a minthaan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kabzeel khuapaw Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah tuh arawthungpaw rhawkaw thua zah, ryalaw lepaw a lahtupaw nynh thua; Moab ccungccaw Ariel ccapaw hae lu ning kha a chia hae. Vuiraw accaw nin khe cceih zah laekarung lungkhu umpaw chindeih kha a chia. <verse number="21" style="v" />Izip ccungccaw apuithyapaw lu kheit kha a chia. Izip paw tuh a kuih kya ccoi a hoi; thuasalama Benaiah nynh hoitang ccyngkute ccianua zah, Izip paw kuih kya-e ccoi kha a lua koute tuh-e ccoi maw te amaw kha a chia. <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh tuh-e ryalaw hae tuh lah zah athungpaw rhawkaw hae lu thum kya a minthaanbua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning tuh ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kya a minthaanbua, thuasalama Lu Thum hae hawte tuh a minthaan khyh. David nynh a pyn rhawviatu hae lupi lang a nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Joab neitaw Asahel tuh ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kya a umbua; Bethlehem khuapaw Dodo ccapaw Elhanan, <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod khuapaw Shammah, Harod khuapaw Elika, <verse number="26" style="v" />Palti ccungccaw Helez, Tekoa khuapaw Ikkesh a ccapaw Ira; <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth khuapaw Abeizer, Hushath ccungccaw Mebunnai; <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahohi ccungccaw Zalmon, Netofah ccungccaw Maharai, <verse number="29" style="v" />Netofah ccungccaw Baanah ccapaw Heled, Benjamin phin hae khua Gibeah ccungccaw Ribai a ccapaw Ittai, <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon ccungccaw Benaiah, Gaash pe umpaw accya e ccungccaw Hiddai, <verse number="31" style="v" />Arbath ccungccaw Abialbon, Bahurim ccungccaw Azmaveth, <verse number="32" style="v" />Shaalbon ccungccaw Eliahba, Jashen ccapaw hae: Jonathan, <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar ccungccaw Sharar ccapaw Ahiam, <verse number="34" style="v" />Maakah ccungccaw Ahasbai ccapaw Elifelet, Gilon ccungccaw Ahithofel ccapaw Eliam, <verse number="35" style="v" />Karmel ccungccaw Hezro, Arbi ccungccaw Paarai, <verse number="36" style="v" />Zobah ccungccaw Nathan ccapaw Igal, Gad ccungccaw Bani, <verse number="37" style="v" />Ammon ccungccaw Zalek, Zeruiah ccapaw Joab a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu Beeroth khuapaw Naharai, <verse number="38" style="v" />Ithri ccungccaw Ira, Ithri ccungccaw Gareb, <verse number="39" style="v" />Hit ccungccaw Uriah: mih balynte sung thum lu sari acih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Israel te Judah Milu A Ria</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1Sh 21.1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah, minmin kha rawsete aning nynh David kha tuhou zah, “La cceih lah, Israel te Judah ccungccaw hae kha milu ria hae,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh Joab te a kya umpaw rhawbawi hae kha, “Israel phin hae balyn kalan khe, Dan kyate Beersheba kyacia, po lekuh lan la cceih oh lah, ccungccaw hae kha la ria oh, ccungccaw hohzeihmou a um hae cipaw ny ka ry,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Joab nynh siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ccungccaw hae kha aleit za kheit pungzaesah hae sah lah, tuh-e tuh siapharan ka bawipaw nynh a mit te muih kho hin vae sah! Thuasalama siapharan ka bawipaw nynh pawccemou hynh-e ryalaw hynh law na ry?” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan bya nynh Joab te rhawbawi hae kha a tae hae. Tukeiccuze Joab te rhawbawi hae tuh Israel ccungccaw hae kha milu ria khylan siapharan malang te a cceih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Jordan vaw kha zuate Aroer khua te accya ngaelung umpaw khua kyate Gad langkhe thokuh hae zah, Jazer khua lang po a cceih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Gilead te Hit hae ram kya umpaw Kadesh kya a thua hae; te Dan a thua hae, Dan kyate Sidon ram lang kouleih hae zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />Tair rhawlungrua te Hiv hae te Kanaan hae khua miakaw kya a thua hae; te Judah ram Neged langkhe cceih hae zah Beersheba kyacia a thua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhcite ram pynpi balyn cceih hae zah sawpaw sah takua te nin kuin aro kou hae te Jerusalem bua a thua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab nynh milu ccazing a law hae paw kha siapharan a pya: Israel ram kya thaloi kyng khopaw milu cciing tarya um zah, Judah ram kya milu cciing pangaw a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Seinaw kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh ccungccaw milu a ria koute a lungvaw asaw. David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Ka cyipaw kya myaryamaw ka sei vae. Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na kalan saw ka sang, na ryalahtupaw ka cyiseinaw hynh beih yn vuapah; pawccecize myarya lepaw ngaeenaw rya kha ka lawsei vae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />David nynh awkhualan awkhua he a tho te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh David a profehpaw Gad kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="12" style="v" />“La cceih lah, David kha la hopah: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Uccaw ccangthum kae pya, tuin kya-e ccangkheit kha pokuh lah, tuh-e tuh na tungvaw ka cyih cih, a ci cite la hopah,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gad nynh David kalan cceih zah, “Na ram kya kum thum lungkhu ccakanccinaw pui tou? Tuhkhyhze sawpaw sah thum lungkhu rhaw hae nynh deekute na rhaw hae kyate ccue tou? Tuhkhyhze na ram kya nin thum lungkhu shethya thua tou? Yn sawtupaw kalan ka kikhaepya lanpaw aphi kha hoyte tua lah, byapaeku tua,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh Gad kha, “Myarya lepaw lungriathaenaw kya nynh ka um; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kya ccah oh sih, pawccecize a thawccinaw tuh myarya ale; thuasalama ccungccaw kuih kya tuh ka ccah nan sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh awkhua te accyh khyapaw kyacia Israel hae tungvaw kya shethya thuasah zah, Dan kyate Beersheba kyacia ccungccaw thong sung sari achih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh Jerusalem kha ro khylan a kuih he a dyngnua tuh, tuh-e hoyleinaw konglang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ngaesikuh zah, ccungccaw hae kalan ronaw a thuakhaepaw vaawpaw kha, “Azaw vae; na kuih kha khin ccavae,” a cipya. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh Jebus ccungccaw Araunah kya-e huimin pe khe a um. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae a theihpaw vaawpaw kha David nynh he a muih tuh, aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha, “Ka makhae kyalya nynh ka sei, ka makhae kyalya nynh hoyleinaw kha ka rae; e tuu hae nynh pawmou a cyi hae? Na kuih tuh kae te ka paaw innbyn tungvaw kya um vae sah, cite ka ngiaku,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Huimin kya David kya-e Silawhang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Gad nynh David kalan yn cceih zah, “Cceih lah, Jebus ccungccaw Araunah kya-e huimin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang kha raepah,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Gad bya thyhte, David tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya hawte a cceihthung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Araunah nynh he a do tuh, siapharan te a ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kalan oun ccia hae paw kha a muih; te Araunah nynh pou zah siapharan malang laekhu kya a bakhung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Araunah nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw nynh pawccemou na ryalahtupaw kalan nae ccia?” a cipya. David nynh, “Ccungccaw hae kya shethya hynh adae ccaw cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang raepya nawlan na huimin hynh re khylan nynh kae ccia,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Araunah nynh David kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw nynh ahoy na ci hawte lawkuh lah, silawtua; maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw tangnuapaw hae a um; maeething lanpaw tuh looh tinnawpaw thing te tangnuapaw taphu hae a um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pou siapharan, e hae balyn hynh Araunah kae nynh siapharan kha kae pya,” a cipya. Te Araunah nynh siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae ccoupah vae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan nynh Araunah kha, “Thua khyh, amee pyate kae re cih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia hanlan amee pya leipaw maee-ute silawnaw kha ka rae lan khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze David nynh huimin te tangnuapaw hae kha ngunphua shekel sung pangaw te a re. <verse number="25" style="v" />David nynh tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang silawhang kha rae zah, maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae. Tukeiccuze ram hanlan a ngiapaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thaepah zah, Israel ram kyate shethya tuh a daesah.</para>
</usx>